# Client dashboard redesign â€” craft spec for Codex

The founder-approved redesign of the client dashboard, designed with the impeccable craft flow (product register, Trakyo visual contract) and handed to Codex to build to production quality against the live data. The Studio is the centerpiece. Design north-star: the live preview at `pulsify-funnels.pages.dev/portal-preview/` (source: `output/standard-preview/portal-preview/index.html`) â€” treat it as the composition/hierarchy/interaction contract, not a screenshot to trace.

## Visual contract (non-negotiable)

- **Design language:** Trakyo. Tokens in `output/standard-preview/shared/pulsify-ui.css` (money-green `#0ea968` + `#34d399`, Inter UI, JetBrains Mono tabular numbers, 3-tier soft shadows, 16px radius, light/dark). The preview file uses the same system inline â€” reconcile into the shared stylesheet.
- **Register: product (app UI).** Bar = "earned familiarity," the Linear/Notion/Stripe standard. The tool disappears into the task. No decorative motion, no display fonts in labels, consistent component vocabulary screen to screen.
- **Progressive disclosure over modals.** Libraries fold and expand inline (accordion). Modals only where the founder asked for an edit pop-up (the generator/edit flow) â€” and those use `inert` on the background + focus trap.

## The product spine (what makes this a SaaS, not a report)

The dashboard is not a set of screens; it's one loop the client runs every week:

**diagnose â†’ create â†’ track â†’ retest â†’ replicate.**

Every surface serves a stage of that loop. The Studio is where it lives. This is the moat â€” the vault's "Action Engine" made concrete ("your hook fails at slide 2, here's the fix, retest it"). Build the loop, not the panels.

## The Studio (centerpiece â€” build this best)

The updated north-star preview stacks six zones, top to bottom. Each maps to a stage of the loop:

1. **Diagnosis engine (insight card)** â€” *diagnose.* Three data-derived lines: the winning type (best completion), the leak (worst-retention slide across live sequences, with the exact % lost), and the prescription ("ship 2 more credibility, retest the value-driven hook"). Two actions wired to the next stage: **Generate {winning type}** and **Retest the leaking hook**. Right rail: 4 week stats with deltas. Every word is computed from the client's own data â€” never invented copy.
2. **Content pipeline** â€” *track (in flight).* Six stages (Ideas / Drafting / In review / Scheduled / Live / Retesting) with live counts. Clicking a stage filters the sequence library. This is the "see everything and do more" surface.
3. **Create** â€” *create.* The 7 sequence types + start-here + story-launch as cards (icon, one-liner, cadence/function/audience chips from the deployment matrix) + a carousel-create row. Click a type -> the generator/edit modal (topic, goal, proof lines -> generated slides -> send for review; the P2 studio-generate contract). Proof field label enforces the standing rule: **student results only, never lifestyle.**
4. **Winning frames** â€” *replicate.* Proven structures the data earned (any sequence >= ~65% completion). Each frame card shows type, "used Nx", "avg N%", slide count, and "Create from this frame" (opens the generator pre-seeded). This is "use the data to make more of what works."
5. **Story sequences library** â€” *track + retest.* Folded rows **labeled by date**, showing status (live/review/testing), completion %, DMs, and a mini retention sparkline (leak bars in rose). Expand reveals: the per-slide diagnosis line, a **variant/retest lineage** (v1 -> v2 testing -> winner) when one exists, the slide strip with per-slide retention % and the leaking slide flagged, and actions: Edit slides / Make another like this / **Retest hook** / View full. A segmented filter (All / Live / In review / Testing) sits in the header. Keyboard-operable throughout.
6. **Carousels library** â€” folded rows **labeled by number (Carousel 01/02/03)** + type + date + saves/reach. Expand -> numbered 9:16 slide tiles + the same actions.

### The retest loop (the differentiator â€” build it real)

When a sequence leaks, the client clicks **Retest hook** -> a modal that names the exact leaking slide and its lost %, pre-fills a new hook, and explains the method (run the new hook on the next posting, hold the other slides identical, compare completion after 48h, the winner becomes the frame). Launching it flips the sequence to `testing`, creates a `v2` variant, and starts tracking. The library then shows the lineage and a "Compare variants" action. This is what "easier to retest" means operationally: one button from any leaking sequence to a tracked, controlled experiment.

New data this needs (Codex builds the endpoints, same auth pattern):
- `studio_sequences` already exists (P2) â€” the library reads approved/draft rows, joined with `sequence_log` metrics + a per-slide retention array.
- New `studio_carousels` table (client_id, num, title, type, slides_json, saves, reach, created_at).
- New `sequence_variants` table (sequence_id, label v1/v2/â€¦, hook_text, status, completion, started_at) to drive the retest lineage + compare.
- New `studio_frames` â€” either a table or a derived view over sequences with completion >= threshold, exposing structure + usage count + avg completion.
- Pipeline state: a `status` enum on sequences (idea/draft/review/scheduled/live/testing) drives both the pipeline counts and the library filter.
- The diagnosis engine computes from `sequence_log` + per-slide retention + `account_snapshots` (best type, worst-retention slide, cadence gap). A small server-side summarizer is cleaner than client math once it's live.

## Cross-cutting SaaS systems (on the whole app, not just Studio)

These are what make it read as a real product (earned familiarity, Linear/Stripe/Raycast bar) rather than a template:

- **Command palette (Ctrl/Cmd-K)** â€” jump to any section, create any sequence type, retest, log metrics, sync, open settings/integrations. Grouped (Go to / Create / Act), arrow+enter keyboard nav, live filter, empty state. This is the "do more, faster" spine and the single biggest "this is a SaaS" signal.
- **Toasts** â€” every mutating action confirms (sent for review, retest launched, logged, synced). Bottom-right, auto-dismiss, non-blocking.
- **Skeleton loading** â€” the "Sync data" action shows shimmer skeletons, not a spinner. All async surfaces load this way.
- **Live/status affordances** â€” a "Live" pulse in the topbar, per-item status pills, connection states on integrations reflecting real `integrations` rows.
- **Full keyboard + focus model** â€” focus-visible rings, role/aria on folds, switches, modals; Escape closes; focus returns to the trigger on close; `prefers-reduced-motion` alternative for all motion.
- **Overlay stacking (learned defect).** Keep a strict semantic z-scale: backdrop below every drawer/modal/palette. An inverted scale (backdrop above the drawer) renders overlays *behind* the blur, which reads as a broken "blurry screen." Verify by paint order (`elementFromPoint` at the panel center hits the panel, not the backdrop), not just by whether the open-class was applied.
- **Voice on all UI copy.** No em-dashes or en-dashes (commas/periods). No reward/celebratory microcopy (no "nice", "great job", exclamation affirmations). Factual, direct, sentence case. Proof-currency rule (student results, never lifestyle) shown as a locked setting.

## The other sections (bring to the same bar)

- **Home / "This week"** â€” replaces Momentum. A money hero (cash this week + all-time + sparkline), followers, $/follower, DMs, a **"Your next move"** prescription card (the diagnosis engine surfaced on the overview, one action into Studio), and shipped-this-week / owed-this-week lists. The one-screen login view.
- **Revenue** â€” money-green KPI cards (JetBrains Mono), payment table, and quick links into the Integrations and Settings tabs.
- **Profile funnel** â€” its own work tab, placed before Studio because the bio is the first conversion mechanism. It must score and rewrite the bio against Niksetting's 3-second stranger test: what is in it for me, is this credible, what do I do next. The surface shows the optimized bio, clarity/polarity/proof/next-step scores, current leaks, the rewrite formula (broad who, specific what, category-of-one name, backtrackable proof), and two CTA paths (DM trigger word plus long-form trust path). Proof copy stays under the Pulsify proof-currency rule: student results only, never lifestyle.
- **Integrations (own tab, marketplace).** A GoHighLevel/ClickFunnels-grade connect surface, not a drawer. A summary strip (connected / available / automations live / last sync), an **Active automations** layer (trigger to action rows with on/off toggles: payment to onboarding, DM-trigger-word to tag+notify, drop-off to draft-retest, booking to Slack alert, Monday to weekly email), and a **marketplace** of ~26 services in 7 categories (payments, email+SMS, booking, content+social, automation+CRM, analytics) with search + category filter. Each service opens a **detail modal**: what it does, what it syncs, permissions/scopes, and connection fields. Connect runs a real `connecting -> connected` loading state with sync toasts; connected cards show last-sync + Manage/Sync-now/Disconnect. Wire to the live integrations hub I1; connected states reflect real `integrations` rows. New tables: `integration_services` (catalog) + reuse `integrations`; `automations` (trigger, action, enabled, run_count).
- **Settings (own tab).** Six sub-sections: Workspace (name, niche, timezone, trigger word, goal, portal link), Brand voice (proof-currency = student-results-only locked rule, banned words, kill-AI-tells toggle), Content (review gate, auto-draft-retest-on-leak, cadence target, default goal), Notifications (weekly report, DM/drop-off/payment alerts), Access (revenue visibility, per-role seat rules), Billing (plan, next invoice, payment method, danger zone: rotate portal link).
- **Performance** â€” KPI cards + a **slide-by-slide retention curve** (SVG area chart, the cliff marked) + a **type leaderboard** (completion bars, top-to-bottom) + sequence rows with bar strips (drop slide in rose) + a "Log sequence" modal (feed the engine) + a reach donut. This is the live P3 data plus the tracking depth the founder asked for.
- **Team** â€” member cards (contact links, "right now" task, day-calendar strip); click -> member modal (full day + task list). Below: a "what everyone's working on" board split by role (operator / content / setter). Needs a `team_members` table (name, role, email, contact, current_task, day_slots_json) + a `team_tasks` table, admin-editable.
- **Plans** â€” multiple plan cards with progress bars + status.
- **To-dos** â€” client-owned checkable items (the creator ticks their own); Pulsify-owned items shown distinct and locked. (P1 to-do check-off already exists; extend for ownership + client-only checking.)

## Production bar (impeccable product register â€” definition of done)

- Every interactive element: default / hover / focus-visible / active / disabled / loading / error. Focus-visible rings (2px accent). Keyboard paths everywhere (accordions, drawers, modals, tabs).
- **Empty states that teach** (no sequences yet -> "Generate your first sequence" with the create CTA), not "nothing here." **Skeleton loaders**, not center spinners.
- Motion 150-250ms, conveys state only (accordion expand, drawer/modal in, tab change). No orchestrated page-load choreography. `prefers-reduced-motion` alternative for all.
- Contrast >=4.5:1 body / >=3:1 large. Watch muted labels on tinted panels â€” bump toward ink if close.
- Consistent vocabulary: one button system, one card system, one badge system across all sections and the admin surface.
- Dark mode correct throughout (toggle + persistence). No horizontal overflow at 390px; sidebar collapses.
- Real data, no placeholder copy at presentation. Sentence case, no emojis/exclamations (CDS content voice).

## Build approach

- This is a real feature build (new data surfaces), not a pure reskin. Structure it in passes: shell + shared tokens -> Studio (the centerpiece) -> Revenue settings/integrations -> Team -> Home/Performance/Plans/To-dos -> states + responsive + a11y.
- Keep all existing P1-P3 logic (auth, studio-generate contract, metrics math) intact; extend, don't rewrite.
- New tables via a fresh migration; new endpoints follow the `resolveClientAccess` + admin-key pattern.
- Local-verify (node --check, local D1, curl the new endpoints). Claude reviews (logic + the production bar) and deploys. No auto-deploy, no remote D1, no commit from Codex.

## Source trail

- Founder feedback 2026-07-12 (studio must connect sequences + carousels, folded/expandable, labeled by date/number, mini widgets, summary/reiterate; revenue settings + integrations; team calendars + task board; kill Momentum). Impeccable craft flow (product register). Design north-star: the deployed preview.

import { checkAdmin, cleanId, json, nowIso, strOrNull } from "../_shared/common.js";
import { resolveClientAccess } from "../_shared/client-auth.js";

const ALLOWED_TYPES = new Set([
  "value-driven",
  "credibility",
  "q&a",
  "day-in-the-life",
  "breakdown",
  "lifestyle",
  "cta",
  "start-here",
  "story launch",
]);

const CADENCE_FLOOR = 3;
const CADENCE_TARGET_MIN = 5;
const CADENCE_TARGET_MAX = 7;

export async function onRequestGet({ request, env }) {
  if (!env.DB) return json({ ok: false, error: "no database bound" }, 500);

  const access = await resolveScopedAccess(request, env, "", true);
  if (access.error) return access.error;

  const url = new URL(request.url);
  const days = clampDays(url.searchParams.get("days"));
  const since = isoDateDaysAgo(days - 1);
  const rows = await env.DB.prepare(
    `SELECT id, client_id, posted_on, type, topic, slide_count, slide_views_json,
            dms, profile_visits, notes, created_at, updated_at
       FROM sequence_log
      WHERE client_id=? AND posted_on>=?
      ORDER BY posted_on DESC, id DESC`,
  ).bind(access.client, since).all();

  const serializedRows = (rows.results || []).map(serializeSequenceRow);
  const weekSummary = buildWeekSummary(serializedRows);

  return json({
    ok: true,
    client: access.client,
    auth_mode: access.auth_mode,
    days,
    rows: serializedRows,
    week_summary: weekSummary,
  });
}

export async function onRequestPost({ request, env }) {
  if (!env.DB) return json({ ok: false, error: "no database bound" }, 500);

  const body = await request.json().catch(() => ({}));
  const access = await resolveScopedAccess(request, env, body.client);
  if (access.error) return access.error;

  const id = Number(body.id || 0) || null;
  const postedOn = normalizeIsoDate(body.posted_on);
  const type = normalizeType(body.type);
  const topic = String(body.topic || "").trim();
  const slideCount = normalizePositiveInteger(body.slide_count, 1, 30);
  const slideViews = normalizeSlideViews(body.slide_views, slideCount);
  const dms = normalizeNullableInteger(body.dms);
  const profileVisits = normalizeNullableInteger(body.profile_visits);
  const notes = strOrNull(body.notes);

  if (!postedOn) return json({ ok: false, error: "posted_on must be an ISO date (YYYY-MM-DD)" }, 422);
  if (!type) return json({ ok: false, error: "valid sequence type is required" }, 422);
  if (!topic) return json({ ok: false, error: "topic is required" }, 422);
  if (slideCount == null) return json({ ok: false, error: "slide_count must be between 1 and 30" }, 422);
  if (!slideViews) {
    return json({ ok: false, error: "slide_views must be an array of non-negative integers, and its length cannot exceed slide_count" }, 422);
  }

  const timestamp = nowIso();
  if (id) {
    const existing = await env.DB.prepare(
      "SELECT id, client_id FROM sequence_log WHERE id=?",
    ).bind(id).first();
    if (!existing || cleanId(existing.client_id) !== access.client) {
      return json({ ok: false, error: "sequence log not found" }, 404);
    }
    await env.DB.prepare(
      `UPDATE sequence_log
          SET posted_on=?, type=?, topic=?, slide_count=?, slide_views_json=?,
              dms=?, profile_visits=?, notes=?, updated_at=?
        WHERE id=?`,
    ).bind(
      postedOn,
      type,
      topic,
      slideCount,
      JSON.stringify(slideViews),
      dms,
      profileVisits,
      notes,
      timestamp,
      id,
    ).run();
    return json({ ok: true, id, updated: true });
  }

  const result = await env.DB.prepare(
    `INSERT INTO sequence_log (
       client_id, posted_on, type, topic, slide_count, slide_views_json,
       dms, profile_visits, notes, created_at, updated_at
     ) VALUES (?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?)`,
  ).bind(
    access.client,
    postedOn,
    type,
    topic,
    slideCount,
    JSON.stringify(slideViews),
    dms,
    profileVisits,
    notes,
    timestamp,
    timestamp,
  ).run();

  return json({ ok: true, id: Number(result.meta?.last_row_id || 0), created: true });
}

export async function onRequestOptions() {
  return new Response(null, {
    headers: {
      "access-control-allow-origin": "*",
      "access-control-allow-methods": "GET, POST, OPTIONS",
      "access-control-allow-headers": "content-type, x-admin-key, x-portal-token",
      "access-control-max-age": "86400",
    },
  });
}

async function resolveScopedAccess(request, env, bodyClient = "", allowImpersonated = false) {
  const adminError = checkAdmin(request, env);
  if (!adminError) {
    const url = new URL(request.url);
    const client = cleanId(bodyClient || url.searchParams.get("client"), "");
    if (!client) return { error: json({ ok: false, error: "client is required for admin requests" }, 422) };
    return { client, auth_mode: "admin" };
  }
  const access = await resolveClientAccess(request, env, {
    allowHeaderToken: true,
    allowImpersonated,
  });
  if (access.error) return { error: access.error };
  return { client: cleanId(access.client), auth_mode: access.auth_mode };
}

function serializeSequenceRow(row) {
  const slideViews = parseSlideViews(row.slide_views_json, Number(row.slide_count || 0));
  const metrics = computeSequenceMetrics(slideViews);
  return {
    id: Number(row.id || 0),
    client_id: row.client_id,
    posted_on: row.posted_on || "",
    type: row.type || "",
    topic: row.topic || "",
    slide_count: Number(row.slide_count || slideViews.length || 0),
    slide_views: slideViews,
    dms: normalizeNullableInteger(row.dms),
    profile_visits: normalizeNullableInteger(row.profile_visits),
    notes: row.notes || "",
    created_at: row.created_at || "",
    updated_at: row.updated_at || "",
    completion_pct: metrics.completionPct,
    dropoff_pct: metrics.dropoffPct,
    biggest_drop_slide: metrics.biggestDropSlide,
    diagnostic: metrics.diagnostic,
  };
}

function computeSequenceMetrics(slideViews) {
  const views = Array.isArray(slideViews) ? slideViews.filter((value) => Number.isFinite(value)) : [];
  const first = Number(views[0] || 0);
  const last = Number(views[views.length - 1] || 0);
  const completionPct = first > 0 ? round1((last / first) * 100) : null;
  const dropoffPct = completionPct == null ? null : round1(Math.max(0, 100 - completionPct));

  let biggestDrop = 0;
  let biggestDropSlide = null;
  for (let index = 1; index < views.length; index += 1) {
    const prior = Number(views[index - 1] || 0);
    const current = Number(views[index] || 0);
    const drop = prior - current;
    if (drop > biggestDrop) {
      biggestDrop = drop;
      biggestDropSlide = index + 1;
    }
  }

  let diagnostic = "monitor";
  if (completionPct != null && completionPct >= 70) diagnostic = "healthy";
  else if (biggestDropSlide === 2) diagnostic = "hook failed";
  else if (biggestDropSlide != null && biggestDropSlide >= 6 && biggestDropSlide <= 8) diagnostic = "body failed before the ask";

  return { completionPct, dropoffPct, biggestDropSlide, diagnostic };
}

function buildWeekSummary(rows) {
  const now = new Date();
  const currentWeekStart = startOfUtcWeek(now);
  const nextWeekStart = addDays(currentWeekStart, 7);
  const priorWeekStart = addDays(currentWeekStart, -7);
  const priorWeekEnd = currentWeekStart;

  const currentWeekRows = rows.filter((row) => row.posted_on >= currentWeekStart && row.posted_on < nextWeekStart);
  const priorWeekRows = rows.filter((row) => row.posted_on >= priorWeekStart && row.posted_on < priorWeekEnd);

  return {
    current_week_start: currentWeekStart,
    prior_week_start: priorWeekStart,
    sequences_this_week: currentWeekRows.length,
    sequences_last_week: priorWeekRows.length,
    cadence_floor: CADENCE_FLOOR,
    cadence_target_min: CADENCE_TARGET_MIN,
    cadence_target_max: CADENCE_TARGET_MAX,
    cadence_status: cadenceStatus(currentWeekRows.length),
    type_mix_current_week: countTypeMix(currentWeekRows),
    type_mix_prior_week: countTypeMix(priorWeekRows),
  };
}

function cadenceStatus(count) {
  if (count >= CADENCE_TARGET_MIN && count <= CADENCE_TARGET_MAX) return "target hit";
  if (count > CADENCE_TARGET_MAX) return "above target";
  if (count >= CADENCE_FLOOR) return "floor hit";
  return "below floor";
}

function countTypeMix(rows) {
  const counts = {};
  for (const row of rows) {
    const key = normalizeType(row.type) || "unknown";
    counts[key] = Number(counts[key] || 0) + 1;
  }
  return counts;
}

function parseSlideViews(value, slideCount) {
  try {
    const parsed = JSON.parse(value || "[]");
    if (!Array.isArray(parsed)) return [];
    return parsed
      .map((item) => normalizeNullableInteger(item))
      .filter((item) => item != null)
      .slice(0, Math.max(0, slideCount || parsed.length));
  } catch {
    return [];
  }
}

function normalizeSlideViews(value, slideCount) {
  if (!Array.isArray(value) || !slideCount) return null;
  if (value.length === 0 || value.length > slideCount) return null;
  const normalized = [];
  for (const item of value) {
    const number = normalizePositiveInteger(item, 0, 1000000000);
    if (number == null) return null;
    normalized.push(number);
  }
  return normalized;
}

function normalizeType(value) {
  const type = String(value || "").trim().toLowerCase();
  return ALLOWED_TYPES.has(type) ? type : "";
}

function normalizeIsoDate(value) {
  const date = String(value || "").trim();
  return /^\d{4}-\d{2}-\d{2}$/.test(date) ? date : "";
}

function normalizeNullableInteger(value) {
  if (value == null || value === "") return null;
  const number = Number(value);
  if (!Number.isFinite(number) || number < 0) return null;
  return Math.round(number);
}

function normalizePositiveInteger(value, min, max) {
  const number = Number(value);
  if (!Number.isFinite(number)) return null;
  const rounded = Math.round(number);
  if (rounded < min || rounded > max) return null;
  return rounded;
}

function clampDays(value) {
  const number = Number(value);
  if (!Number.isFinite(number)) return 60;
  return Math.max(1, Math.min(365, Math.round(number)));
}

function isoDateDaysAgo(daysAgo) {
  const date = new Date();
  date.setUTCHours(0, 0, 0, 0);
  date.setUTCDate(date.getUTCDate() - Math.max(0, daysAgo));
  return date.toISOString().slice(0, 10);
}

function startOfUtcWeek(date) {
  const copy = new Date(Date.UTC(date.getUTCFullYear(), date.getUTCMonth(), date.getUTCDate()));
  const day = copy.getUTCDay();
  const diff = day === 0 ? -6 : 1 - day;
  copy.setUTCDate(copy.getUTCDate() + diff);
  return copy.toISOString().slice(0, 10);
}

function addDays(isoDate, deltaDays) {
  const date = new Date(`${isoDate}T00:00:00.000Z`);
  date.setUTCDate(date.getUTCDate() + deltaDays);
  return date.toISOString().slice(0, 10);
}

function round1(value) {
  return Math.round(Number(value || 0) * 10) / 10;
}

import { checkAdmin, cleanId, json, parseJson } from "../_shared/common.js";
import { resolveClientAccess } from "../_shared/client-auth.js";

export async function onRequestGet({ request, env }) {
  if (!env.DB) return json({ ok: false, error: "no database bound" }, 500);

  const url = new URL(request.url);
  const isAdmin = request.headers.get("x-admin-key") === env.ADMIN_KEY && Boolean(env.ADMIN_KEY);
  if (isAdmin && url.searchParams.get("status") === "review") {
    const rows = await env.DB.prepare(
      `SELECT id, client_id, type, intent, topic, goal, trigger_word, params_json, output_json,
              manual_prompt, status, review_note, created_at, updated_at
         FROM studio_sequences
        WHERE status='review'
        ORDER BY updated_at DESC, id DESC`,
    ).all();
    return json({ ok: true, rows: (rows.results || []).map(serializeRow) });
  }

  const access = await resolveClientAccess(request, env, {
    allowHeaderToken: true,
    allowImpersonated: true,
  });
  if (access.error) return access.error;

  const client = cleanId(access.client);
  const rows = await env.DB.prepare(
    `SELECT id, client_id, type, intent, topic, goal, trigger_word, params_json, output_json,
            manual_prompt, status, review_note, created_at, updated_at
       FROM studio_sequences
      WHERE client_id=?
      ORDER BY updated_at DESC, id DESC`,
  ).bind(client).all();
  return json({ ok: true, rows: (rows.results || []).map(serializeRow) });
}

export async function onRequestPost({ request, env }) {
  if (!env.DB) return json({ ok: false, error: "no database bound" }, 500);

  const body = await request.json().catch(() => ({}));
  const action = String(body.action || "").trim().toLowerCase();
  const id = Number(body.id || 0);

  if (action === "approve" || action === "reject") {
    const auth = checkAdmin(request, env);
    if (auth) return auth;
    if (!id) return json({ ok: false, error: "sequence id is required" }, 422);
    const note = String(body.note || "").trim();
    if (action === "reject" && !note) {
      return json({ ok: false, error: "review note is required when rejecting" }, 422);
    }
    const status = action === "approve" ? "approved" : "rejected";
    const result = await env.DB.prepare(
      `UPDATE studio_sequences
          SET status=?, review_note=?, updated_at=?
        WHERE id=?`,
    ).bind(status, note || null, new Date().toISOString(), id).run();
    if (!Number(result.meta?.changes || 0)) {
      return json({ ok: false, error: "sequence not found" }, 404);
    }
    return json({ ok: true, status });
  }

  const adminError = checkAdmin(request, env);
  const isAdmin = action === "attach-output" && !adminError;
  const access = await resolveClientAccess(request, env, { allowHeaderToken: true });
  if (!isAdmin && access.error) return access.error;
  if (!id) return json({ ok: false, error: "sequence id is required" }, 422);

  if (action === "attach-output") {
    return attachOutput(env, body, id, isAdmin ? null : access, isAdmin);
  }

  const client = cleanId(access.client);

  const row = await env.DB.prepare(
    `SELECT id, client_id, status
       FROM studio_sequences
      WHERE id=?`,
  ).bind(id).first();
  if (!row || cleanId(row.client_id) !== client) {
    return json({ ok: false, error: "sequence not found" }, 404);
  }

  if (action === "submit-for-review") {
    if (row.status !== "draft" && row.status !== "rejected") {
      return json({ ok: false, error: "only draft or rejected sequences can be sent for review" }, 422);
    }
    await env.DB.prepare(
      `UPDATE studio_sequences
          SET status='review', review_note=NULL, updated_at=?
        WHERE id=?`,
    ).bind(new Date().toISOString(), id).run();
    return json({ ok: true, status: "review" });
  }

  if (action === "delete") {
    if (row.status !== "draft") {
      return json({ ok: false, error: "only draft sequences can be deleted" }, 422);
    }
    await env.DB.prepare("DELETE FROM studio_sequences WHERE id=?").bind(id).run();
    return json({ ok: true, deleted: true });
  }

  return json({ ok: false, error: "unknown action" }, 422);
}

export async function onRequestOptions() {
  return new Response(null, {
    headers: {
      "access-control-allow-origin": "*",
      "access-control-allow-methods": "GET, POST, OPTIONS",
      "access-control-allow-headers": "content-type, x-admin-key, x-portal-token",
      "access-control-max-age": "86400",
    },
  });
}

function serializeRow(row) {
  return {
    id: Number(row.id || 0),
    client_id: row.client_id,
    type: row.type || "",
    intent: row.intent || "",
    topic: row.topic || "",
    goal: row.goal || "",
    trigger_word: row.trigger_word || "",
    params: parseJson(row.params_json, {}),
    output: parseJson(row.output_json, null),
    manual_prompt: row.manual_prompt || "",
    status: row.status || "draft",
    review_note: row.review_note || "",
    created_at: row.created_at || "",
    updated_at: row.updated_at || "",
  };
}

async function attachOutput(env, body, id, access, isAdmin) {
  const rawText = String(body.raw_text || "").trim();
  if (!rawText) return json({ ok: false, error: "raw_text is required" }, 422);

  const row = await env.DB.prepare(
    `SELECT id, client_id, status
       FROM studio_sequences
      WHERE id=?`,
  ).bind(id).first();
  if (!row) return json({ ok: false, error: "sequence not found" }, 404);

  if (!isAdmin) {
    if (cleanId(row.client_id) !== cleanId(access.client)) {
      return json({ ok: false, error: "sequence not found" }, 404);
    }
  }

  const parsed = parseAttachedOutput(rawText);
  const nextStatus = isAdmin ? (row.status || "draft") : "review";
  await env.DB.prepare(
    `UPDATE studio_sequences
        SET output_json=?, status=?, review_note=NULL, updated_at=?
      WHERE id=?`,
  ).bind(
    JSON.stringify(parsed),
    nextStatus,
    new Date().toISOString(),
    id,
  ).run();

  return json({ ok: true, status: nextStatus, output: parsed });
}

function parseAttachedOutput(rawText) {
  const text = String(rawText || "").trim();
  if (!text) return { raw_text: "" };
  try {
    const cleaned = text
      .replace(/^```(?:json)?\s*/i, "")
      .replace(/```\s*$/i, "")
      .trim();
    const parsed = JSON.parse(cleaned);
    if (looksLikeSequenceOutput(parsed)) {
      return parsed;
    }
  } catch {
    // Fall through to raw_text payload.
  }
  return { raw_text: text };
}

function looksLikeSequenceOutput(value) {
  if (!value || typeof value !== "object" || Array.isArray(value)) return false;
  if (!Array.isArray(value.slides)) return false;
  return true;
}

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Pulsify client dashboard preview</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tabler/icons-webfont@3.24.0/dist/tabler-icons.min.css">
<style>
:root{
  --bg:#f4f6f8; --panel:#fff; --panel-2:#fafbfc; --panel-3:#f4f6f8; --line:#e8ebef; --line-2:#dde1e7;
  --ink:#0c0e13; --ink-2:#3b4150; --muted:#667085;
  --accent:#0ea968; --accent-2:#34d399; --accent-ink:#067a4a; --accent-soft:rgba(14,169,104,.10); --accent-line:rgba(14,169,104,.30);
  --indigo:#5b6cff; --indigo-soft:rgba(91,108,255,.10); --indigo-ink:#3a49d6;
  --amber:#e08e0b; --amber-soft:rgba(224,142,11,.12); --amber-ink:#8a5a06;
  --rose:#f43f5e; --rose-soft:rgba(244,63,94,.10); --rose-ink:#c11f3b;
  --sky:#0ea5e9; --sky-soft:rgba(14,165,233,.12);
  --shadow-xs:0 1px 2px rgba(13,15,20,.05);
  --shadow-sm:0 1px 2px rgba(13,15,20,.04),0 2px 6px rgba(13,15,20,.05);
  --shadow-md:0 8px 30px -12px rgba(13,15,20,.20);
  --shadow-lg:0 30px 70px -22px rgba(13,15,20,.32);
  --radius:16px; --radius-sm:11px; --radius-xs:8px;
  --z-sticky:10; --z-backdrop:30; --z-drawer:40; --z-modal:60; --z-cmdk:80; --z-toast:90;
  --ease:cubic-bezier(.22,.8,.28,1);
}
body.dark{
  --bg:#0a0b0f; --panel:#111318; --panel-2:#15181e; --panel-3:#0e1015; --line:#20242c; --line-2:#2b3039;
  --ink:#f2f4f7; --ink-2:#c4c9d2; --muted:#7a808c;
  --accent-ink:#5ee0a3; --accent-soft:rgba(14,169,104,.15); --accent-line:rgba(14,169,104,.36);
  --indigo-ink:#9aa6ff; --indigo-soft:rgba(91,108,255,.18);
  --amber-ink:#f0b552; --amber-soft:rgba(224,142,11,.16);
  --rose-ink:#ff7d92; --rose-soft:rgba(244,63,94,.15);
  --shadow-xs:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.4);
  --shadow-sm:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.3),0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.35);
  --shadow-md:0 12px 36px -14px rgba(0,0,0,.66); --shadow-lg:0 34px 80px -26px rgba(0,0,0,.78);
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{margin:0;font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;text-rendering:optimizeLegibility}
.mono{font-family:"JetBrains Mono",ui-monospace,monospace;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;letter-spacing:-.02em}
button{font-family:inherit;cursor:pointer;border:none;background:none;color:inherit}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
::selection{background:var(--accent-soft);color:var(--accent-ink)}
:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:2px;border-radius:6px}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{transition-duration:.01ms!important;animation-duration:.01ms!important;animation-iteration-count:1!important;scroll-behavior:auto!important}}
#app{display:grid;grid-template-columns:236px minmax(0,1fr);min-height:100vh}
/* rail */
.rail{position:sticky;top:0;height:100vh;background:var(--panel);border-right:1px solid var(--line);padding:18px 14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;z-index:var(--z-sticky);overflow-y:auto}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;padding:6px 8px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);margin-bottom:8px}
.brand-mark{width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:9px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-weight:800;font-size:16px;box-shadow:0 6px 16px -6px var(--accent)}
.brand-text b{display:block;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:-.03em;line-height:1.2}
.brand-text span{display:block;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600}
.nav-h{font-size:10px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.11em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);padding:14px 10px 5px}
.nav-item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;padding:8px 11px;border-radius:10px;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;transition:background .15s,color .15s;position:relative;text-align:left;width:100%}
.nav-item .ic{width:18px;text-align:center;opacity:.7;font-size:17px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
.nav-item:hover{background:var(--panel-2);color:var(--ink)}
.nav-item.active{background:var(--accent-soft);color:var(--accent-ink)}
.nav-item.active .ic{opacity:1}
.nav-item .count{margin-left:auto;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:var(--muted);background:var(--panel-2);padding:1px 7px;border-radius:99px}
.nav-item.active .count{background:var(--accent-soft);color:var(--accent-ink)}
.nav-item .live-dot{margin-left:auto;width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px var(--accent-soft)}
.rail-foot{margin-top:auto;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);display:grid;gap:2px}
.cmdk-hint{margin:8px 8px 2px;padding:9px 11px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--panel-2);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;transition:.15s}
.cmdk-hint:hover{border-color:var(--line-2);color:var(--ink)}
.cmdk-hint kbd{margin-left:auto;font-family:"JetBrains Mono",monospace;font-size:10.5px;background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;padding:2px 6px;color:var(--ink-2)}
/* topbar + main */
main{min-width:0}
.topbar{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:var(--z-sticky);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;padding:14px 30px;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--bg) 80%,transparent);backdrop-filter:blur(12px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.crumb{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px}
.crumb b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:700}
.crumb .live{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent-ink);background:var(--accent-soft);padding:3px 9px;border-radius:99px}
.crumb .live i{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent);animation:pulse 2s var(--ease) infinite}
@keyframes pulse{0%,100%{opacity:1;transform:scale(1)}50%{opacity:.4;transform:scale(.8)}}
.top-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px}
.icon-btn{width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--panel);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:17px;transition:.15s;position:relative}
.icon-btn:hover{border-color:var(--line-2);color:var(--ink);box-shadow:var(--shadow-xs)}
.icon-btn .ping{position:absolute;top:8px;right:9px;width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent)}
.section{padding:24px 30px 80px}
.panel{display:none}.panel.active{display:block}
.panel.active>*{animation:rise .4s var(--ease) both}
.panel.active>*:nth-child(2){animation-delay:.04s}
.panel.active>*:nth-child(3){animation-delay:.08s}
.panel.active>*:nth-child(4){animation-delay:.12s}
.panel.active>*:nth-child(5){animation-delay:.16s}
@keyframes rise{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(9px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}
.h-row{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:20px}
.h-row h1{margin:0;font-size:26px;letter-spacing:-.045em;line-height:1.05}
.h-row p{margin:6px 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;max-width:64ch}
.h-actions{display:flex;gap:9px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;padding:9px 14px;border-radius:11px;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;transition:.15s;white-space:nowrap}
.btn:active{transform:translateY(1px)}
.btn i{font-size:15px}
.btn-primary{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));color:#fff;box-shadow:0 8px 20px -8px var(--accent)}
.btn-primary:hover{filter:brightness(1.05);box-shadow:0 10px 26px -8px var(--accent)}
.btn-ghost{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink)}
.btn-ghost:hover{border-color:var(--line-2);box-shadow:var(--shadow-xs)}
.btn-soft{background:var(--accent-soft);color:var(--accent-ink)}
.btn-soft:hover{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent-soft) 70%,var(--accent))}
.btn-dark{background:var(--ink);color:var(--bg)}
.btn-dark:hover{filter:brightness(1.1)}
.btn-danger{background:var(--rose-soft);color:var(--rose-ink)}
.btn-danger:hover{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--rose-soft) 60%,var(--rose))}
.btn-sm{padding:6px 10px;font-size:11.5px;border-radius:9px}
/* week strip */
.week-strip{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.35fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:14px;margin-bottom:16px}
.week-hero{border-radius:var(--radius);padding:20px;background:linear-gradient(140deg,var(--accent),#0a8a55 74%,#087a4b);color:#fff;position:relative;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:var(--shadow-md)}
.week-hero::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(120% 90% at 92% 8%,rgba(255,255,255,.22),transparent 55%);pointer-events:none}
.week-hero .lab{font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.09em;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:.9}
.week-hero .big{font-size:34px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:8px 0 2px;position:relative}
.week-hero .sub{font-size:12.5px;opacity:.92;position:relative}
.week-hero .spark{position:absolute;right:16px;bottom:14px;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:3px;height:44px;z-index:1}
.week-hero .spark i{width:6px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.6)}
.mini{border-radius:var(--radius);padding:16px 18px;background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm)}
.mini .lab{font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:var(--muted)}
.mini .v{font-size:23px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin-top:8px}
.mini .d{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;margin-top:5px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px}
.up{color:var(--accent-ink)}.down{color:var(--rose-ink)}
/* cards + grids */
.grid{display:grid;gap:16px}.g2{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.g3{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr))}.g4{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}
.card{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm)}
.card-pad{padding:20px}
.card-head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding:15px 20px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.card-head h3{margin:0;font-size:14.5px;letter-spacing:-.02em;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.card-head .sub{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}
.kpi{padding:18px 20px}
.kpi-top{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
.kpi .ic{width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:18px}
.kpi .lab{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;color:var(--muted);margin-top:14px}
.kpi .v{font-size:28px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.05em;margin-top:5px}
.kpi .d{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;margin-top:6px;display:inline-flex;gap:4px;align-items:center}
.kpi .src{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:4px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}
.kpi .src i.dot{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent);flex:none}
.badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:4px 9px;border-radius:8px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.2;white-space:nowrap}
.b-green{background:var(--accent-soft);color:var(--accent-ink)}
.b-amber{background:var(--amber-soft);color:var(--amber-ink)}
.b-rose{background:var(--rose-soft);color:var(--rose-ink)}
.b-indigo{background:var(--indigo-soft);color:var(--indigo-ink)}
.b-sky{background:var(--sky-soft);color:#0774a3}
.b-gray{background:var(--panel-3);color:var(--muted);border:1px solid var(--line)}
.dotb{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;flex:none}
/* home next-action */
.next{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr auto;gap:16px;align-items:center;padding:18px 20px;border-radius:var(--radius);background:radial-gradient(120% 160% at 0% 0%,var(--accent-soft),transparent 42%),var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--accent-line);box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm)}
.next .nic{width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:13px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:22px;box-shadow:0 8px 18px -8px var(--accent);flex:none}
.next h3{margin:0;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:-.02em}
.next p{margin:4px 0 0;font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.5}
/* performance */
.seq{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:14px;align-items:center;padding:15px 18px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;background:var(--panel);transition:.15s}
.seq:hover{border-color:var(--line-2);box-shadow:var(--shadow-xs)}
.seq-bars{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:4px;height:44px;margin-top:10px}
.seq-bars i{flex:1;border-radius:4px 4px 2px 2px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--accent-2),var(--accent));min-width:5px}
.seq-bars i.drop{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fca5a5,var(--rose))}
.seq h4{margin:0;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:-.02em}
.seq .meta{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:4px;display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center}
.donut{width:130px;height:130px}
.legend{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px;font-size:12.5px}
.legend .row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.legend .dot{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:3px}
.curve-wrap{position:relative}
.curve-svg{width:100%;height:150px;display:block;overflow:visible}
.curve-note{display:flex;gap:8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:12px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}
.lb-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:120px 1fr 48px;gap:12px;align-items:center;padding:9px 0}
.lb-row .nm{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;text-transform:capitalize}
.lb-track{height:9px;border-radius:99px;background:var(--panel-3);overflow:hidden}
.lb-track i{display:block;height:100%;border-radius:99px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2))}
.lb-track i.dim{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--line-2),var(--muted));opacity:.55}
.lb-val{font-family:"JetBrains Mono",monospace;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;text-align:right}
/* studio type cards */
.studio-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(196px,1fr));gap:13px}
.type-card{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);background:var(--panel);padding:17px;text-align:left;position:relative;overflow:hidden;transition:transform .18s var(--ease),box-shadow .18s,border-color .18s}
.type-card:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:var(--shadow-md);border-color:var(--accent-line)}
.type-card:focus-visible{transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:var(--shadow-md)}
.type-card .ic{width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:11px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:19px;margin-bottom:12px}
.type-card b{display:block;font-size:14.5px;letter-spacing:-.02em;text-transform:capitalize}
.type-card p{margin:6px 0 12px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5;min-height:36px}
.type-card .chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}
.type-card .go{position:absolute;top:15px;right:15px;color:var(--muted);font-size:16px;opacity:0;transform:translateX(-4px);transition:.18s}
.type-card:hover .go{opacity:1;transform:none;color:var(--accent-ink)}
/* pipeline */
.pipe{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(6,1fr);gap:8px;margin-bottom:6px}
.pipe-stage{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:13px;background:var(--panel);padding:13px 14px;text-align:left;transition:.15s;position:relative}
.pipe-stage:hover{border-color:var(--line-2);box-shadow:var(--shadow-xs)}
.pipe-stage.on{border-color:var(--accent-line);background:var(--accent-soft)}
.pipe-stage .st-top{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em;color:var(--muted)}
.pipe-stage .st-top .dotb{width:7px;height:7px}
.pipe-stage .n{font-size:22px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin-top:8px}
.pipe-stage .lb{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px}
.pipe-flow{display:flex;align-items:center;color:var(--line-2);font-size:14px}
/* insight */
.insight{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.55fr 1fr;gap:0;overflow:hidden;position:relative}
.insight::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(120% 130% at 0% 0%,var(--accent-soft),transparent 46%);pointer-events:none}
.insight-main{padding:22px 24px;position:relative}
.insight-lab{font-size:11px;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--accent-ink);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px}
.diag-line{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-2);margin:11px 0;line-height:1.5}
.diag-line .di{width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:7px;flex:none;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:13px;margin-top:1px}
.diag-line b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:700}
.insight-actions{display:flex;gap:9px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:16px}
.insight-stats{background:var(--panel-2);border-left:1px solid var(--line);padding:20px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px 14px;align-content:center;position:relative}
.i-stat span{font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em;color:var(--muted)}
.i-stat b{display:block;font-size:23px;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin-top:4px}
.i-stat small{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted)}.i-stat small.up{color:var(--accent-ink);font-weight:700}
/* section labels */
.lib-h{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;margin-bottom:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.lib-h h3{margin:0;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:-.03em;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.lib-h h3 i{font-size:18px}
.lib-sub{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}
.seg{display:inline-flex;gap:3px;padding:3px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;background:var(--panel-2);margin-left:auto}
.seg button{padding:5px 11px;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--muted);transition:.14s}
.seg button.on{background:var(--panel);color:var(--ink);box-shadow:var(--shadow-xs)}
.carousel-create{width:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding:15px 18px;border:1px dashed var(--line-2);border-radius:var(--radius);background:var(--panel);transition:.15s;text-align:left}
.carousel-create:hover{border-color:var(--indigo);background:var(--indigo-soft)}
.carousel-create .ic{width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:11px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:18px;flex:none}
.carousel-create b{font-size:14.5px}.carousel-create p{margin:3px 0 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}
/* frames */
.frames{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(230px,1fr));gap:13px}
.frame{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;background:linear-gradient(150deg,var(--panel),var(--panel-2));padding:16px;transition:.16s;text-align:left;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.frame:hover{border-color:var(--accent-line);box-shadow:var(--shadow-md);transform:translateY(-2px)}
.frame .ft{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em;color:var(--accent-ink)}
.frame h4{margin:9px 0 3px;font-size:14.5px;letter-spacing:-.02em}
.frame .fm{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:8px}
.frame .fm b{color:var(--ink);font-family:"JetBrains Mono",monospace}
.frame .steps{display:flex;gap:3px;margin:13px 0 2px}
.frame .steps i{flex:1;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:var(--accent-soft)}
.frame .frame-cta{margin-top:13px;width:100%;justify-content:center}
/* accordion */
.fold{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;background:var(--panel);margin-bottom:10px;overflow:hidden;transition:box-shadow .16s,border-color .16s}
.fold.open{border-color:var(--accent-line);box-shadow:var(--shadow-md)}
.fold-head{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr auto;gap:16px;align-items:center;padding:14px 18px;cursor:pointer}
.fold-head:hover{background:var(--panel-2)}
.fold-tag{font-family:"JetBrains Mono",monospace;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--muted);min-width:74px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px}
.fold-tag .status{font-size:9px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase}
.fold-title{min-width:0}
.fold-title b{font-size:14px;letter-spacing:-.02em;display:block;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
.fold-title .sub{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:3px;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}
.fold-widgets{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center}
.mini-w{text-align:center;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:9px;background:var(--panel-2);border:1px solid var(--line);min-width:52px}
.mini-w b{display:block;font-family:"JetBrains Mono",monospace;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:-.02em}
.mini-w span{font-size:9px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.04em;color:var(--muted)}
.mini-spark{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:2px;height:26px;padding:0 3px}
.mini-spark i{width:4px;border-radius:2px;background:var(--accent);opacity:.85}
.mini-spark i.drop{background:var(--rose)}
.fold-chev{color:var(--muted);font-size:18px;transition:transform .22s var(--ease)}
.fold.open .fold-chev{transform:rotate(180deg);color:var(--accent-ink)}
.fold-body{display:grid;grid-template-rows:0fr;transition:grid-template-rows .28s var(--ease)}
.fold.open .fold-body{grid-template-rows:1fr}
.fold-body>div{overflow:hidden}
.fold-inner{padding:2px 18px 18px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.fold-diag{display:flex;gap:11px;align-items:flex-start;background:var(--panel-2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:11px;padding:12px 14px;margin:14px 0;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.5}
.fold-diag .di{width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:8px;flex:none;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:14px}
.fold-diag b{color:var(--ink)}
.mini-slides{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(128px,1fr));gap:10px;margin:6px 0 14px}
.mini-slide{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:11px;padding:12px;background:var(--panel-2);min-height:92px;position:relative}
.mini-slide .n{font-size:9px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.05em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent-ink)}
.mini-slide .t{font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.4;margin-top:6px}
.mini-slide .ret{position:absolute;bottom:8px;right:10px;font-family:"JetBrains Mono",monospace;font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--muted)}
.mini-slide.leak{border-color:var(--rose);background:var(--rose-soft)}
.mini-slide.leak .n{color:var(--rose-ink)}
.mini-slide.leak .ret{color:var(--rose-ink)}
.car-slides{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(86px,1fr));gap:8px;margin:12px 0}
.car-slide{aspect-ratio:9/16;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(165deg,var(--panel-2),var(--panel-3));border:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;padding:9px;position:relative}
.car-slide .num{font-family:"JetBrains Mono",monospace;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:var(--indigo-ink)}
.car-slide .cap{font-size:9.5px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.3}
.lineage{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0;margin:12px 0;flex-wrap:wrap}
.lineage .v{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;background:var(--panel-2);font-size:12px}
.lineage .v b{font-family:"JetBrains Mono",monospace}
.lineage .v.win{border-color:var(--accent-line);background:var(--accent-soft);color:var(--accent-ink)}
.lineage .arr{color:var(--muted);padding:0 8px;font-size:14px}
.fold-actions{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:6px}
/* profile funnel */
.profile-hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr .85fr;gap:16px;margin-bottom:16px}
.bio-preview{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);background:var(--panel);box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm);overflow:hidden}
.bio-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:17px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--panel-2)}
.bio-avatar{width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:14px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:800;flex:none}
.bio-name b{display:block;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:-.02em}
.bio-name span{display:block;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px}
.bio-lines{display:grid;gap:8px;padding:17px 18px}
.bio-line{display:flex;gap:9px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.45}
.bio-line i{color:var(--accent-ink);margin-top:2px;flex:none}
.bio-line.warn i{color:var(--rose-ink)}
.bio-line b{color:var(--ink)}
.bio-actions{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:0 18px 18px}
.bio-score{border:1px solid var(--accent-line);background:radial-gradient(110% 130% at 0 0,var(--accent-soft),transparent 50%),var(--panel);border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm);padding:20px}
.score-ring{width:118px;height:118px;border-radius:50%;background:conic-gradient(var(--accent) 0 78%,var(--line) 78% 100%);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:16px;position:relative}
.score-ring::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:10px;background:var(--panel);border-radius:50%}
.score-ring span{position:relative;font-family:"JetBrains Mono",monospace;font-size:25px;font-weight:800;color:var(--accent-ink)}
.bio-score h3{margin:0;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:-.025em}
.bio-score p{margin:7px 0 14px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.55}
.bio-axis{display:grid;gap:9px}
.axis-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:115px 1fr auto;gap:10px;align-items:center;font-size:12px}
.axis-row .nm{font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-2)}
.axis-track{height:8px;border-radius:99px;background:var(--panel-3);overflow:hidden}
.axis-track i{display:block;height:100%;border-radius:99px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2))}
.axis-row .val{font-family:"JetBrains Mono",monospace;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:var(--muted)}
.bio-test{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px;margin-bottom:16px}
.test-card{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;background:var(--panel);padding:16px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-xs);transition:.14s}
.test-card:hover{border-color:var(--line-2);box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm)}
.test-card .top{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;margin-bottom:9px}
.test-card h4{margin:0;font-size:13.5px;letter-spacing:-.015em}
.test-card p{margin:0;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5}
.bio-builder{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px}
.issue-list{display:grid;gap:10px}
.issue{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;background:var(--panel);padding:13px;transition:.14s}
.issue:hover{border-color:var(--line-2);box-shadow:var(--shadow-xs)}
.issue .ii{width:27px;height:27px;border-radius:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex:none;font-size:14px}
.issue b{display:block;font-size:13px}
.issue span{display:block;font-size:11.8px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.45;margin-top:3px}
.bio-formula{display:grid;gap:10px}
.formula-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:134px 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:start;padding:12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;background:var(--panel)}
.formula-row .key{font-size:11px;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;color:var(--muted)}
.formula-row .txt{font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.45}
.formula-row .txt b{color:var(--ink)}
.cta-paths{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}
.cta-card{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;background:var(--panel);padding:15px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-xs)}
.cta-card .ic{width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:10px}
.cta-card h4{margin:0;font-size:13.5px}
.cta-card p{margin:5px 0 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5}
/* team */
.team-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(244px,1fr));gap:14px}
.member{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);background:var(--panel);padding:18px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm);transition:.15s}
.member:hover{border-color:var(--line-2);box-shadow:var(--shadow-md)}
.member-top{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
.avatar{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:800;font-size:15px;color:#fff;flex:none}
.member h4{margin:0;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:-.02em}
.member .role{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}
.member .contact{margin-top:14px;display:grid;gap:7px;font-size:12.5px}
.member .contact a{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;color:var(--ink-2)}
.member .contact a:hover{color:var(--accent-ink)}
.member .now{margin-top:14px;padding-top:13px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.member .now .lab{font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;color:var(--muted)}
.member .now .task{font-size:13px;margin-top:6px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.member .now .task i{color:var(--accent-ink)}
.day{display:flex;gap:5px;margin-top:12px}
.day .slot{flex:1;height:30px;border-radius:7px;background:var(--panel-2);border:1px solid var(--line);font-size:9px;color:var(--muted);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700}
.day .slot.busy{background:var(--accent-soft);border-color:var(--accent-line);color:var(--accent-ink)}
.board{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px}
.col-h{font-size:12px;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:10px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between}
.task-card{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:13px;margin-bottom:10px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-xs);transition:.14s}
.task-card:hover{border-color:var(--line-2)}
.task-card .t{font-size:13px;font-weight:600}
.task-card .who{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px}
.who .av{width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:6px;font-size:10px;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700}
/* plans + todos */
.plan{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);background:var(--panel);padding:18px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm);transition:.15s}
.plan:hover{border-color:var(--line-2);box-shadow:var(--shadow-md)}
.plan-top{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px}
.plan h4{margin:0;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:-.02em}
.plan .bar{height:7px;border-radius:99px;background:var(--panel-3);margin:14px 0 8px;overflow:hidden}
.plan .bar i{display:block;height:100%;border-radius:99px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));transition:width .5s var(--ease)}
.plan p{margin:0;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.55}
.plan .pmeta{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:12px;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted);align-items:center}
.todo{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px;padding:14px 16px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:13px;background:var(--panel);margin-bottom:10px;transition:.15s}
.todo:hover{border-color:var(--line-2)}
.todo .chk{width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:7px;border:2px solid var(--line-2);flex:none;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-size:12px;cursor:pointer;transition:.15s;margin-top:1px}
.todo .chk i{opacity:0;transform:scale(.5);transition:.15s}
.todo.done .chk{background:var(--accent);border-color:var(--accent)}
.todo.done .chk i{opacity:1;transform:none}
.todo .t{font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600}
.todo.done .t{text-decoration:line-through;color:var(--muted)}
.todo .m{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:4px}
.owner{font-size:10px;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em;padding:3px 7px;border-radius:6px;white-space:nowrap}
.owner.you{background:var(--accent-soft);color:var(--accent-ink)}.owner.pf{background:var(--indigo-soft);color:var(--indigo-ink)}
/* integrations */
.intg-summary{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(150px,1fr));gap:14px;margin-bottom:24px}
.sum-card{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;background:var(--panel);padding:15px 17px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm)}
.sum-card .l{font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;color:var(--muted)}
.sum-card .v{font-size:22px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin-top:7px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.sum-card .v .dotb{width:9px;height:9px}
.auto-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr auto auto;gap:14px;align-items:center;padding:14px 16px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:13px;background:var(--panel);margin-bottom:10px;transition:.14s}
.auto-row:hover{border-color:var(--line-2);box-shadow:var(--shadow-xs)}
.auto-ic{width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--accent-soft);color:var(--accent-ink);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:18px;flex:none}
.auto-flow{font-size:13px;line-height:1.45}
.auto-flow .step{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;font-weight:600}
.auto-flow .arr{color:var(--muted);margin:0 9px}
.auto-flow .sub{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px}
.auto-runs{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);font-family:"JetBrains Mono",monospace;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap}
.cat-bar{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:0 0 16px}
.cat-chip{padding:7px 13px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:99px;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--muted);background:var(--panel);transition:.14s;white-space:nowrap}
.cat-chip:hover{border-color:var(--line-2);color:var(--ink)}
.cat-chip.on{background:var(--ink);color:var(--bg);border-color:var(--ink)}
.search{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:11px;background:var(--panel);padding:9px 13px;max-width:320px;margin-bottom:16px}
.search i{color:var(--muted);font-size:16px}
.search input{border:none;background:none;outline:none;font:inherit;font-size:13px;color:var(--ink);width:100%}
.svc-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(288px,1fr));gap:12px}
.svc{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;background:var(--panel);padding:16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:11px;transition:.15s;min-height:150px}
.svc:hover{border-color:var(--line-2);box-shadow:var(--shadow-md)}
.svc-top{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px}
.svc-logo{width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:11px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;flex:none}
.svc-top .in{flex:1;min-width:0}
.svc-top b{font-size:14px;letter-spacing:-.01em}
.svc-top .cat{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)}
.svc p{margin:0;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.45;flex:1}
.svc-foot{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px}
.svc .stt{font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;color:var(--muted)}
.svc .stt.on{color:var(--accent-ink)}
.svc .stt .dot{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent)}
.spin{width:14px;height:14px;border:2px solid var(--line-2);border-top-color:var(--accent);border-radius:50%;animation:spin .7s linear infinite;display:inline-block;flex:none}
@keyframes spin{to{transform:rotate(360deg)}}
.det-block{margin:18px 0}
.det-block h5{margin:0 0 9px;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;color:var(--muted)}
.det-syncs{display:grid;gap:9px}
.det-sync{display:flex;gap:9px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.4}
.det-sync i{color:var(--accent-ink);margin-top:2px}
.det-scope{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px}
/* settings tab */
.subtabs{display:flex;gap:4px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);margin-bottom:22px;overflow-x:auto}
.subtab{padding:11px 14px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--muted);border-bottom:2px solid transparent;white-space:nowrap;transition:.14s}
.subtab.on{color:var(--ink);border-color:var(--accent)}
.subtab:hover{color:var(--ink)}
.set-sec{display:none}.set-sec.on{display:block;animation:rise .3s var(--ease) both}
.set-card{max-width:640px}
.set-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:0 16px}
/* skeleton + empty */
.sk{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--panel-3) 25%,var(--panel-2) 50%,var(--panel-3) 75%);background-size:200% 100%;animation:shimmer 1.3s linear infinite;border-radius:8px}
@keyframes shimmer{to{background-position:-200% 0}}
.sk-fold{height:60px;margin-bottom:10px}
.empty{text-align:center;padding:44px 20px;border:1px dashed var(--line-2);border-radius:var(--radius);background:var(--panel-2)}
.empty .ei{width:50px;height:50px;border-radius:14px;background:var(--accent-soft);color:var(--accent-ink);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:24px;margin:0 auto 14px}
.empty h4{margin:0 0 5px;font-size:15px}
.empty p{margin:0 auto 16px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);max-width:40ch;line-height:1.5}
/* drawer + modal */
.backdrop{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(9,11,16,.5);backdrop-filter:blur(3px);z-index:var(--z-backdrop);opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .2s}
.backdrop.show{opacity:1;pointer-events:auto}
.modal{position:fixed;left:50%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-46%) scale(.97);width:min(720px,94vw);max-height:88vh;background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:20px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-lg);z-index:var(--z-modal);opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .2s,transform .24s var(--ease);display:flex;flex-direction:column;overflow:hidden}
.modal.show{opacity:1;pointer-events:auto;transform:translate(-50%,-50%) scale(1)}
.modal-head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding:19px 24px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.modal-head .ic{width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:12px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:20px;flex:none}
.modal-head h3{margin:0;font-size:19px;letter-spacing:-.03em;text-transform:capitalize}
.modal-head .sub{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px}
.modal-body{padding:22px 24px;overflow:auto}
.field{display:grid;gap:7px;margin-bottom:15px}
.field label{font-size:12px;font-weight:700}
.field .hint{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:400}
.field input,.field select,.field textarea{width:100%;padding:11px 13px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:11px;background:var(--panel-2);color:var(--ink);font:inherit;font-size:13px;transition:.14s}
.field textarea{resize:vertical;min-height:82px;line-height:1.5}
.field input:focus,.field select:focus,.field textarea:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--accent);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px var(--accent-soft)}
.slide-strip{display:grid;gap:10px}
.slide-mini{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:14px;background:var(--panel-2);position:relative;transition:.14s}
.slide-mini:hover{border-color:var(--line-2)}
.slide-mini .n{font-size:10px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent-ink)}
.slide-mini .txt{font-size:13px;margin-top:6px;line-height:1.5}
.slide-mini .photo{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px;display:flex;gap:7px;align-items:flex-start}
.modal-foot{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:15px 24px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--panel-2)}
.set-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.set-row:last-child{border-bottom:none}
.set-row .l b{display:block;font-size:13.5px}
.set-row .l span{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}
.switch{width:42px;height:24px;border-radius:99px;background:var(--line-2);position:relative;flex:none;transition:.18s;cursor:pointer}
.switch.on{background:var(--accent)}
.switch i{position:absolute;top:3px;left:3px;width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;transition:.2s var(--ease);box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.25)}
.switch.on i{left:21px}
.note{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2);background:var(--panel-2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:11px;padding:12px 14px;line-height:1.55}
.note b{color:var(--ink)}
/* command palette */
.cmdk-wrap{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:var(--z-cmdk);display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:center;padding-top:13vh;background:rgba(9,11,16,.44);backdrop-filter:blur(4px);opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .16s}
.cmdk-wrap.show{opacity:1;pointer-events:auto}
.cmdk{width:min(600px,94vw);background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line-2);border-radius:16px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-lg);overflow:hidden;transform:translateY(-8px) scale(.99);transition:transform .18s var(--ease)}
.cmdk-wrap.show .cmdk{transform:none}
.cmdk-in{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;padding:15px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.cmdk-in i{font-size:19px;color:var(--muted)}
.cmdk-in input{flex:1;border:none;background:none;font:inherit;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink);outline:none}
.cmdk-list{max-height:min(52vh,420px);overflow:auto;padding:8px}
.cmdk-group{font-size:10px;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--muted);padding:12px 12px 5px}
.cmdk-item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:10px;cursor:pointer;font-size:13.5px}
.cmdk-item .ci{width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--panel-2);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:16px;color:var(--ink-2);flex:none}
.cmdk-item .csub{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:1px}
.cmdk-item .kbd{margin-left:auto;font-family:"JetBrains Mono",monospace;font-size:10px;color:var(--muted)}
.cmdk-item.active{background:var(--accent-soft)}
.cmdk-item.active .ci{background:var(--accent);color:#fff}
.cmdk-item.active .cmain b{color:var(--accent-ink)}
.cmdk-empty{padding:34px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
.cmdk-foot{display:flex;gap:16px;padding:10px 16px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)}
.cmdk-foot span{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px}
.cmdk-foot kbd{font-family:"JetBrains Mono",monospace;background:var(--panel-2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:5px;padding:1px 5px}
/* toasts */
.toasts{position:fixed;right:20px;bottom:20px;z-index:var(--z-toast);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;pointer-events:none}
.toast{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line-2);border-radius:13px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-lg);padding:13px 16px;min-width:280px;max-width:360px;animation:toastIn .28s var(--ease) both}
.toast.out{animation:toastOut .24s var(--ease) forwards}
@keyframes toastIn{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px) scale(.98)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}
@keyframes toastOut{to{opacity:0;transform:translateX(20px)}}
.toast .ti-ic{width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:9px;background:var(--accent-soft);color:var(--accent-ink);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:17px;flex:none}
.toast.sync .ti-ic{background:var(--indigo-soft);color:var(--indigo-ink)}
.toast b{font-size:13px;display:block}
.toast span{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}
.preview-flag{position:fixed;left:20px;bottom:20px;z-index:70;background:var(--ink);color:var(--bg);font-size:12px;font-weight:600;padding:9px 15px;border-radius:99px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-lg);display:flex;gap:9px;align-items:center}
.preview-flag .dot{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent-2)}
/* design system reference */
.ds-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr 1fr;gap:16px}
.ds-legend{display:grid;gap:11px}
.ds-row{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.4}
.ds-key{width:80px;flex:none;font-weight:700;font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.04em;color:var(--muted);padding-top:1px}
.slide-real{border-radius:14px;background:linear-gradient(160deg,#1b1e26,#0d1015);border:1px solid var(--line);padding:16px;color:#fff;position:relative;overflow:hidden;min-height:210px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;justify-content:center}
.slide-real .imgclass{position:absolute;top:9px;right:9px;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em;color:rgba(255,255,255,.55);background:rgba(255,255,255,.09);padding:3px 8px;border-radius:6px;z-index:2}
.slide-real .ghost{position:absolute;left:10px;top:-10px;font-size:78px;font-weight:800;color:rgba(255,255,255,.06);line-height:1;z-index:0}
.pillbox{align-self:flex-start;background:#fff;color:#0c0e13;font-weight:800;font-size:14px;line-height:1.18;padding:7px 11px;border-radius:9px;max-width:94%;z-index:1;position:relative}
.pillbox .red{color:#f43f5e}
.mk{display:inline-block;font-weight:800;font-size:15px;position:relative;padding-bottom:9px;z-index:1}
.mk .u{position:absolute;left:0;bottom:1px;width:100%;height:7px}
.slide-real .body{font-size:12px;line-height:1.45;text-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.7);color:rgba(255,255,255,.92);z-index:1;position:relative}
.slide-real .receipt{align-self:flex-start;border:2.5px solid #f43f5e;border-radius:9px;padding:6px 10px;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;transform:rotate(-1.4deg);z-index:1}
.slide-real .receipt .red{color:#f43f5e}
/* design direction on generated slides */
.dd{margin-top:10px;padding-top:9px;border-top:1px dashed var(--line);display:grid;gap:6px}
.dd-row{display:flex;gap:9px;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);align-items:flex-start}
.dd-row b{color:var(--ink-2);font-weight:700;min-width:72px;flex:none;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.03em;font-size:10px;padding-top:1px}
.dd-chip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px}
.dd-dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;flex:none}
/* reels */
.reel-modes{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px;margin-bottom:24px}
.mode-card{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);background:var(--panel);padding:18px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm)}
.mode-card .ic{width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:11px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:19px;margin-bottom:12px}
.mode-card h4{margin:0 0 5px;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:-.02em}
.mode-card p{margin:0 0 13px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5}
.capture{border:1px solid var(--accent-line);border-radius:var(--radius);background:radial-gradient(120% 150% at 0 0,var(--accent-soft),transparent 45%),var(--panel);padding:18px;margin-bottom:18px}
.capture h3{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:-.02em}
.capture p{margin:0 0 13px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink-2)}
.capture-in{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center}
.capture-in input{flex:1;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:11px;background:var(--panel-2);padding:12px 14px;font:inherit;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink)}
.capture-in input:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--accent);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px var(--accent-soft)}
.thought{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;background:var(--panel);margin-bottom:10px;overflow:hidden;transition:box-shadow .15s,border-color .15s}
.thought.open{border-color:var(--indigo-soft);box-shadow:var(--shadow-md)}
.thought-head{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr auto;gap:13px;align-items:center;padding:14px 16px;cursor:pointer}
.thought-head:hover{background:var(--panel-2)}
.thought .tic{width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--indigo-soft);color:var(--indigo-ink);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:17px;flex:none}
.thought .txt{font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600}
.thought .angle{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}
.thought-body{display:grid;grid-template-rows:0fr;transition:grid-template-rows .28s var(--ease)}
.thought.open .thought-body{grid-template-rows:1fr}
.thought-body>div{overflow:hidden}
.translate{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(210px,1fr));gap:11px;padding:2px 16px 16px}
.fmt{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;background:var(--panel-2);padding:13px;display:flex;flex-direction:column}
.fmt .ft{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.04em;color:var(--accent-ink)}
.fmt p{margin:8px 0 11px;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.45;flex:1}
.angle-lib{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(228px,1fr));gap:12px}
.angle-card{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:13px;background:var(--panel);padding:15px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-xs)}
.angle-card .from{font-size:13px;font-weight:700}
.angle-card .to{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:7px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;line-height:1.4}
.angle-card .to i{color:var(--accent-ink)}
.rotator{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);background:var(--panel);padding:18px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm)}
.rot-belief{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;padding:12px 14px;border-radius:11px;background:var(--accent-soft);color:var(--accent-ink);margin-bottom:13px}
.rot-list{display:grid;gap:9px}
.rot-item{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:center;font-size:12.5px;padding:11px 13px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:11px;color:var(--ink-2)}
.rot-item .tag{font-size:10px;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.04em;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:var(--panel-2);color:var(--muted);border:1px solid var(--line);white-space:nowrap}
/* responsive */
@media(max-width:1180px){.week-strip{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.pipe{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}.pipe .pipe-flow{display:none}.insight{grid-template-columns:1fr}.insight-stats{border-left:none;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}}
@media(max-width:1080px){.g3,.g4,.board{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.g2{grid-template-columns:1fr}.perf-2,.profile-hero,.bio-builder,.ds-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr!important}.bio-test,.cta-paths{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}
@media(max-width:820px){#app{grid-template-columns:1fr;overflow-x:hidden}.rail{position:sticky;height:auto;width:100%;max-width:100vw;flex-direction:row;overflow-x:auto;overflow-y:visible;gap:4px;align-items:center;padding:10px}.rail .nav-h,.rail-foot,.brand span,.cmdk-hint{display:none}.nav-item{white-space:nowrap;width:auto}.nav-item .count,.nav-item .live-dot{display:none}.section{padding:20px 16px 70px}.topbar{padding:12px 16px}.week-strip,.g3,.g4,.board,.bio-test,.cta-paths,.reel-modes{grid-template-columns:1fr}.pipe{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.set-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.auto-row{grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;gap:10px}.auto-runs{display:none}.axis-row{grid-template-columns:92px 1fr auto}.formula-row{grid-template-columns:1fr}.next{grid-template-columns:1fr}.next .nic{display:none}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div id="app">
  <aside class="rail">
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="brand-mark">P</div>
      <div class="brand-text"><b>Rio Vance</b><span>Pulsify workspace</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="nav-h">Overview</div>
    <button class="nav-item active" data-tab="home"><span class="ic"><i class="ti ti-layout-grid"></i></span> Home</button>
    <button class="nav-item" data-tab="revenue"><span class="ic"><i class="ti ti-currency-dollar"></i></span> Revenue</button>
    <button class="nav-item" data-tab="performance"><span class="ic"><i class="ti ti-chart-histogram"></i></span> Performance</button>
    <div class="nav-h">Work</div>
    <button class="nav-item" data-tab="profile"><span class="ic"><i class="ti ti-user-search"></i></span> Profile <span class="count">3</span></button>
    <button class="nav-item" data-tab="studio"><span class="ic"><i class="ti ti-sparkles"></i></span> Studio <span class="count">7</span></button>
    <button class="nav-item" data-tab="reels"><span class="ic"><i class="ti ti-video"></i></span> Reels <span class="count">5</span></button>
    <button class="nav-item" data-tab="plans"><span class="ic"><i class="ti ti-map-2"></i></span> Plans</button>
    <button class="nav-item" data-tab="todos"><span class="ic"><i class="ti ti-checkbox"></i></span> To-dos <span class="count">3</span></button>
    <button class="nav-item" data-tab="team"><span class="ic"><i class="ti ti-users"></i></span> Team</button>
    <div class="nav-h">Setup</div>
    <button class="nav-item" data-tab="integrations"><span class="ic"><i class="ti ti-plug-connected"></i></span> Integrations <span class="live-dot"></span></button>
    <button class="nav-item" data-tab="settings"><span class="ic"><i class="ti ti-settings"></i></span> Settings</button>
    <div class="rail-foot">
      <button class="cmdk-hint" onclick="openCmdk()"><i class="ti ti-command"></i> Quick actions <kbd>Ctrl K</kbd></button>
      <button class="nav-item" onclick="toggleTheme()"><span class="ic"><i class="ti ti-moon"></i></span> Theme</button>
    </div>
  </aside>

  <main>
    <div class="topbar">
      <div class="crumb">Workspace / <b id="crumb">Home</b> <span class="live"><i></i> Live</span></div>
      <div class="top-actions">
        <button class="icon-btn" onclick="openCmdk()" title="Quick actions (Ctrl K)"><i class="ti ti-command"></i></button>
        <button class="icon-btn" onclick="go('integrations')" title="Integrations"><i class="ti ti-plug-connected"></i><span class="ping"></span></button>
        <button class="icon-btn" onclick="go('settings')" title="Settings"><i class="ti ti-settings"></i></button>
        <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="go('studio')"><i class="ti ti-plus"></i> New sequence</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- HOME -->
    <section class="section panel active" data-panel="home">
      <div class="h-row"><div><h1>This week</h1><p>The one screen that shows the system working.</p></div>
        <div class="h-actions"><button class="btn btn-ghost" onclick="go('performance')"><i class="ti ti-chart-histogram"></i> Full metrics</button><button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="go('studio')"><i class="ti ti-sparkles"></i> Open Studio</button></div>
      </div>
      <div class="week-strip">
        <div class="week-hero">
          <div class="lab">Cash collected, this week</div>
          <div class="big mono">$3,000</div>
          <div class="sub">2 payments, $8,000 all-time</div>
          <div class="spark"><i style="height:40%"></i><i style="height:65%"></i><i style="height:50%"></i><i style="height:80%"></i><i style="height:70%"></i><i style="height:100%"></i></div>
        </div>
        <div class="mini"><div class="lab">Followers</div><div class="v mono">9,100</div><div class="d up"><i class="ti ti-trending-up"></i> +900 wk</div></div>
        <div class="mini"><div class="lab">$ / follower</div><div class="v mono">$0.88</div><div class="d up"><i class="ti ti-trending-up"></i> +$0.12 wk</div></div>
        <div class="mini"><div class="lab">DMs from stories</div><div class="v mono">41</div><div class="d up"><i class="ti ti-trending-up"></i> +12 wk</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="next" style="margin-bottom:16px">
        <div class="nic"><i class="ti ti-bolt"></i></div>
        <div><h3>Your next move</h3><p>The bio now passes the 3-second test. Lock the proof trail, then push traffic into the two CTA paths.</p></div>
        <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="go('profile')">Open Profile <i class="ti ti-arrow-right"></i></button>
      </div>
      <div class="grid g2">
        <div class="card"><div class="card-head"><h3><i class="ti ti-circle-check" style="color:var(--accent-ink)"></i> Shipped this week</h3><span class="badge b-green">3 done</span></div><div class="card-pad" style="display:grid;gap:12px">
          <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;font-size:13.5px"><i class="ti ti-circle-check-filled" style="color:var(--accent)"></i> Bio rewrite drafted</div>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;font-size:13.5px"><i class="ti ti-circle-check-filled" style="color:var(--accent)"></i> 3 story sequences posted</div>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;font-size:13.5px"><i class="ti ti-circle-check-filled" style="color:var(--accent)"></i> Drop-off tracking on all stories</div>
        </div></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="card-head"><h3><i class="ti ti-clock" style="color:var(--amber-ink)"></i> Owed this week</h3><span class="badge b-amber">2 open</span></div><div class="card-pad" style="display:grid;gap:12px">
          <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;font-size:13.5px"><i class="ti ti-circle" style="color:var(--muted)"></i> Send 3 student result screenshots <span class="owner you" style="margin-left:auto">You</span></div>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;font-size:13.5px"><i class="ti ti-circle" style="color:var(--muted)"></i> Record the value-driven sequence <span class="owner you" style="margin-left:auto">You</span></div>
        </div></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- REVENUE -->
    <section class="section panel" data-panel="revenue">
      <div class="h-row"><div><h1>Revenue</h1><p>Live from your connected payment rails.</p></div>
        <div class="h-actions"><button class="btn btn-ghost" onclick="go('integrations')"><i class="ti ti-plug-connected"></i> Rails</button><button class="btn btn-ghost" onclick="go('settings')"><i class="ti ti-settings"></i> Settings</button></div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid g4" style="margin-bottom:16px">
        <div class="card kpi"><div class="kpi-top"><div class="ic" style="background:var(--accent-soft);color:var(--accent-ink)"><i class="ti ti-currency-dollar"></i></div></div><div class="lab">All-time collected</div><div class="v mono">$8,000</div><div class="src"><i class="dot"></i> Stripe, live</div></div>
        <div class="card kpi"><div class="kpi-top"><div class="ic" style="background:var(--indigo-soft);color:var(--indigo-ink)"><i class="ti ti-calendar-dollar"></i></div></div><div class="lab">This month</div><div class="v mono">$3,000</div><div class="d up"><i class="ti ti-trending-up"></i> +60%</div></div>
        <div class="card kpi"><div class="kpi-top"><div class="ic" style="background:var(--amber-soft);color:var(--amber-ink)"><i class="ti ti-receipt"></i></div></div><div class="lab">Payments</div><div class="v mono">2</div><div class="src" style="color:var(--muted)">avg $4,000</div></div>
        <div class="card kpi"><div class="kpi-top"><div class="ic" style="background:var(--accent-soft);color:var(--accent-ink)"><i class="ti ti-target-arrow"></i></div></div><div class="lab">$100k tracker</div><div class="v mono">8%</div><div class="src" style="color:var(--muted)">$8k of $100k</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="card"><div class="card-head"><h3>Payment history</h3><button class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" onclick="go('settings')"><i class="ti ti-adjustments"></i> Configure</button></div>
        <div class="card-pad" style="display:grid;gap:0">
          <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto auto auto;gap:14px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;color:var(--muted);padding-bottom:12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)"><span>Note</span><span>Rail</span><span>Date</span><span style="text-align:right">Amount</span></div>
          <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto auto auto;gap:14px;font-size:13px;padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);align-items:center"><span>Program payment</span><span class="badge b-indigo">Stripe</span><span class="mono" style="color:var(--muted)">Jul 5</span><span class="mono" style="text-align:right;font-weight:800">$5,000</span></div>
          <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto auto auto;gap:14px;font-size:13px;padding:14px 0;align-items:center"><span>Upsell</span><span class="badge b-indigo">Stripe</span><span class="mono" style="color:var(--muted)">Jul 11</span><span class="mono" style="text-align:right;font-weight:800">$3,000</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- PERFORMANCE -->
    <section class="section panel" data-panel="performance">
      <div class="h-row"><div><h1>Performance</h1><p>What the data says: where you win, where you leak, what to fix.</p></div><button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="openLog()"><i class="ti ti-plus"></i> Log sequence</button></div>
      <div class="grid g4" style="margin-bottom:16px">
        <div class="card kpi"><div class="lab">Avg completion</div><div class="v mono">56%</div><div class="d up"><i class="ti ti-trending-up"></i> +4 pts wk</div></div>
        <div class="card kpi"><div class="lab">Cadence</div><div class="v mono">4 / 7</div><div class="src" style="color:var(--muted)">target 5 to 7</div></div>
        <div class="card kpi"><div class="lab">DMs from stories</div><div class="v mono">41</div><div class="d up"><i class="ti ti-trending-up"></i> +12</div></div>
        <div class="card kpi"><div class="lab">Best type</div><div class="v" style="font-size:19px;margin-top:9px">Credibility</div><div class="src" style="color:var(--muted)">74% completion</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid perf-2" style="grid-template-columns:1.3fr 1fr;margin-bottom:16px">
        <div class="card card-pad"><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:4px"><h3 style="margin:0;font-size:14.5px">Where stories drop off</h3><span class="badge b-gray">avg of 4 live sequences</span></div>
          <p style="margin:6px 0 4px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted)">Slide-by-slide retention. The cliff is where the hook or the ask fails.</p>
          <div class="curve-wrap" id="curveWrap"></div>
          <div class="curve-note"><span class="badge b-rose">slide 2</span> biggest cliff, 41% of viewers leave. Fix the hook, not the offer.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="card card-pad"><h3 style="margin:0 0 3px;font-size:14.5px">Type leaderboard</h3>
          <p style="margin:6px 0 14px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted)">Completion by sequence type. Make more of the top.</p>
          <div id="leaderboard"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid g2">
        <div class="card"><div class="card-head"><h3>Recent sequences</h3><span class="sub">drop-off diagnostic</span></div><div class="card-pad" style="display:grid;gap:12px">
          <div class="seq"><div><h4>Student hit 50k month</h4><div class="meta"><span class="badge b-green">credibility</span><span>Jul 11</span><span>18 DMs</span></div><div class="seq-bars"><i style="height:100%"></i><i class="drop" style="height:74%"></i><i style="height:70%"></i><i style="height:67%"></i><i style="height:64%"></i><i style="height:62%"></i><i style="height:60%"></i><i style="height:58%"></i></div></div><div style="text-align:right"><span class="badge b-amber">hook soft</span><div class="mono" style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px">58% done</div></div></div>
          <div class="seq"><div><h4>How the profile funnel works</h4><div class="meta"><span class="badge b-indigo">value-driven</span><span>Jul 12</span><span>6 DMs</span></div><div class="seq-bars"><i style="height:100%"></i><i class="drop" style="height:37%"></i><i style="height:36%"></i><i style="height:34%"></i><i style="height:34%"></i><i style="height:33%"></i><i style="height:33%"></i></div></div><div style="text-align:right"><span class="badge b-rose">hook failed</span><div class="mono" style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px">33% done</div></div></div>
        </div></div>
        <div class="card card-pad"><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:6px"><h3 style="margin:0;font-size:14.5px">Audience reach</h3><span class="badge b-gray">this week</span></div>
          <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;margin-top:16px">
            <svg class="donut" viewBox="0 0 42 42"><circle cx="21" cy="21" r="15.9" fill="none" stroke="var(--line)" stroke-width="6"></circle><circle cx="21" cy="21" r="15.9" fill="none" stroke="var(--indigo)" stroke-width="6" stroke-dasharray="62 38" stroke-dashoffset="25" stroke-linecap="round"></circle><circle cx="21" cy="21" r="15.9" fill="none" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="6" stroke-dasharray="38 62" stroke-dashoffset="-37" stroke-linecap="round"></circle></svg>
            <div class="legend">
              <div class="row"><span class="dot" style="background:var(--indigo)"></span> Non-followers <b class="mono" style="margin-left:auto">62%</b></div>
              <div class="row"><span class="dot" style="background:var(--accent)"></span> Followers <b class="mono" style="margin-left:auto">38%</b></div>
              <div class="row" style="color:var(--muted);font-size:11.5px;margin-top:4px">21,043 views, reaching cold audience</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- PROFILE -->
    <section class="section panel" data-panel="profile">
      <div class="h-row"><div><h1>Profile funnel</h1><p>The profile front door. Bio first, then proof, highlights, story sequences, and DMs.</p></div>
        <div class="h-actions"><button class="btn btn-ghost" onclick="openBioModal()"><i class="ti ti-edit"></i> Edit bio</button><button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="toast('Bio rewrite queued','Pulsify will review the profile pass')"><i class="ti ti-send"></i> Send for review</button></div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid g4" style="margin-bottom:16px">
        <div class="card kpi"><div class="lab">Bio score</div><div class="v mono">78%</div><div class="d up"><i class="ti ti-trending-up"></i> +26 pts after rewrite</div></div>
        <div class="card kpi"><div class="lab">3-second test</div><div class="v mono">3 / 3</div><div class="src" style="color:var(--muted)">what, proof, next step</div></div>
        <div class="card kpi"><div class="lab">Filter strength</div><div class="v" style="font-size:19px;margin-top:9px">Sharper</div><div class="src" style="color:var(--muted)">repels low-intent followers</div></div>
        <div class="card kpi"><div class="lab">CTA paths</div><div class="v mono">2</div><div class="src" style="color:var(--muted)">DM trigger plus long-form</div></div>
      </div>

      <div class="profile-hero">
        <div class="bio-preview">
          <div class="bio-head">
            <div class="bio-avatar">RV</div>
            <div class="bio-name"><b>Rio Vance</b><span>@riovance</span></div>
            <span class="badge b-green" style="margin-left:auto">optimized draft</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bio-lines">
            <div class="bio-line"><i class="ti ti-target-arrow"></i><div><b>I help creators build subscription dropshipping brands.</b></div></div>
            <div class="bio-line"><i class="ti ti-fingerprint"></i><div>Creator of the Repeat Purchase Engine.</div></div>
            <div class="bio-line"><i class="ti ti-shield-check"></i><div>Student proof logged from Stripe screenshots and post-call notes.</div></div>
            <div class="bio-line"><i class="ti ti-message-2"></i><div>DM <b>ELEVATE</b> or watch the full breakdown below.</div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="bio-actions">
            <button class="btn btn-soft btn-sm" onclick="openBioModal()"><i class="ti ti-pencil"></i> Refine lines</button>
            <button class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" onclick="toast('Copied','Optimized bio on clipboard')"><i class="ti ti-copy"></i> Copy bio</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bio-score">
          <div class="score-ring"><span>78%</span></div>
          <h3>Bio passes the stranger test</h3>
          <p>It answers the three questions in under 3 seconds: what is in it for me, why should I trust this, and what do I do next.</p>
          <div class="bio-axis">
            <div class="axis-row"><span class="nm">Clarity</span><span class="axis-track"><i style="width:88%"></i></span><span class="val">88</span></div>
            <div class="axis-row"><span class="nm">Polarity</span><span class="axis-track"><i style="width:74%"></i></span><span class="val">74</span></div>
            <div class="axis-row"><span class="nm">Proof</span><span class="axis-track"><i style="width:68%"></i></span><span class="val">68</span></div>
            <div class="axis-row"><span class="nm">Next step</span><span class="axis-track"><i style="width:82%"></i></span><span class="val">82</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bio-test">
        <div class="test-card"><div class="top"><h4>What's in it for me?</h4><span class="badge b-green">pass</span></div><p>Clear outcome, subscription dropshipping brands, without a revenue-band box.</p></div>
        <div class="test-card"><div class="top"><h4>Is this credible?</h4><span class="badge b-amber">tighten</span></div><p>Proof is checkable, but the exact student result needs a pinned post or highlight.</p></div>
        <div class="test-card"><div class="top"><h4>What do I do next?</h4><span class="badge b-green">pass</span></div><p>Two paths: DM trigger for intent, full breakdown for trust.</p></div>
      </div>

      <div class="bio-builder">
        <div class="card"><div class="card-head"><h3><i class="ti ti-alert-circle" style="color:var(--rose-ink)"></i> Current leaks</h3><span class="sub">Niksetting bio doctrine</span></div>
          <div class="card-pad issue-list">
            <div class="issue"><div class="ii" style="background:var(--rose-soft);color:var(--rose-ink)"><i class="ti ti-category-minus"></i></div><div><b>Generic category words</b><span>"Ecom coach" and "make money online" enter a crowded comparison set.</span></div></div>
            <div class="issue"><div class="ii" style="background:var(--amber-soft);color:var(--amber-ink)"><i class="ti ti-box-padding"></i></div><div><b>Identity box is too narrow</b><span>Calling out founders, beginners, or a revenue band deselects qualified buyers.</span></div></div>
            <div class="issue"><div class="ii" style="background:var(--indigo-soft);color:var(--indigo-ink)"><i class="ti ti-shield-question"></i></div><div><b>Proof needs a trail</b><span>Use proof a stranger can verify from a pinned post, highlight, or case study.</span></div></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card"><div class="card-head"><h3><i class="ti ti-tools" style="color:var(--accent-ink)"></i> Rewrite formula</h3><button class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" onclick="openBioModal()">Open editor</button></div>
          <div class="card-pad bio-formula">
            <div class="formula-row"><div class="key">Who</div><div class="txt"><b>Creators</b>, broad enough to avoid boxing the buyer.</div></div>
            <div class="formula-row"><div class="key">What</div><div class="txt"><b>Subscription dropshipping brands</b>, specific enough to create instant relevance.</div></div>
            <div class="formula-row"><div class="key">Name</div><div class="txt"><b>Repeat Purchase Engine</b>, a category-of-one label that creates curiosity.</div></div>
            <div class="formula-row"><div class="key">Proof</div><div class="txt"><b>Student screenshots and notes</b>, backtrackable proof that supports the claim.</div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lib-h" style="margin-top:24px"><h3><i class="ti ti-route" style="color:var(--accent-ink)"></i> CTA routing</h3><span class="lib-sub">The bio should make a decision easy, not send every visitor to the same place.</span></div>
      <div class="cta-paths">
        <div class="cta-card"><div class="ic" style="background:var(--accent-soft);color:var(--accent-ink)"><i class="ti ti-message-2"></i></div><h4>DM trigger word</h4><p><b>ELEVATE</b> routes warm intent to the setter, tags the lead, and starts qualification.</p></div>
        <div class="cta-card"><div class="ic" style="background:var(--indigo-soft);color:var(--indigo-ink)"><i class="ti ti-brand-youtube"></i></div><h4>Long-form trust path</h4><p>The full breakdown gives skeptical buyers more proof before they start a DM.</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- STUDIO -->
    <section class="section panel" data-panel="studio">
      <div class="h-row"><div><h1>Studio</h1><p>Your content engine. Diagnose, create, track, retest, replicate.</p></div>
        <div class="h-actions"><button class="btn btn-ghost" onclick="reloadLib()"><i class="ti ti-refresh"></i> Sync data</button><button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="scrollToEl('createRow')"><i class="ti ti-plus"></i> Create</button></div>
      </div>
      <div class="insight card" style="margin-bottom:18px">
        <div class="insight-main">
          <div class="insight-lab"><i class="ti ti-bulb"></i> This week's read</div>
          <div class="diag-line"><div class="di" style="background:var(--accent-soft);color:var(--accent-ink)"><i class="ti ti-trophy"></i></div><div><b>Credibility is your best type.</b> 74% completion, 18 DMs a run. Student-result proof is carrying it.</div></div>
          <div class="diag-line"><div class="di" style="background:var(--rose-soft);color:var(--rose-ink)"><i class="ti ti-alert-triangle"></i></div><div><b>Value-driven leaks at slide 2.</b> The hook loses 41% before the payoff. This is a hook problem, not a topic problem.</div></div>
          <div class="diag-line"><div class="di" style="background:var(--indigo-soft);color:var(--indigo-ink)"><i class="ti ti-arrow-right"></i></div><div><b>The play.</b> Ship 2 more credibility sequences off your winning frame, then retest the value-driven opener.</div></div>
          <div class="insight-actions"><button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="openType(1)"><i class="ti ti-sparkles"></i> Generate a credibility sequence</button><button class="btn btn-soft" onclick="openRetest(0)"><i class="ti ti-flask"></i> Retest the leaking hook</button></div>
        </div>
        <div class="insight-stats">
          <div class="i-stat"><span>Sequences</span><b class="mono">12</b><small>this week</small></div>
          <div class="i-stat"><span>Carousels</span><b class="mono">3</b><small>this week</small></div>
          <div class="i-stat"><span>Avg completion</span><b class="mono">56%</b><small class="up">+4 pts</small></div>
          <div class="i-stat"><span>DMs generated</span><b class="mono">41</b><small class="up">+12</small></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="lib-h"><h3><i class="ti ti-arrow-guide" style="color:var(--accent-ink)"></i> Content pipeline</h3><span class="lib-sub">Everything in flight. Click a stage to filter the library.</span></div>
      <div class="pipe" id="pipe" style="margin-bottom:26px"></div>
      <div class="lib-h" id="createRow"><h3><i class="ti ti-plus" style="color:var(--accent-ink)"></i> Create new</h3><span class="lib-sub">Pick a type, then build, edit, and send for review.</span></div>
      <div class="studio-grid" id="studioGrid" style="margin-bottom:13px"></div>
      <button class="carousel-create" onclick="openCarouselCreate()"><div class="ic" style="background:var(--indigo-soft);color:var(--indigo-ink)"><i class="ti ti-layout-grid"></i></div><div style="flex:1"><b>Carousel</b><p>Methodology, taxonomy, or philosophy set, designed slide by slide.</p></div><i class="ti ti-arrow-right" style="color:var(--muted)"></i></button>
      <div class="lib-h" style="margin-top:28px"><h3><i class="ti ti-award" style="color:var(--accent-ink)"></i> Winning frames</h3><span class="lib-sub">Proven structures the data earned. Reuse the skeleton, swap the proof.</span></div>
      <div class="frames" id="frames" style="margin-bottom:8px"></div>

      <div class="lib-h" style="margin-top:28px"><h3><i class="ti ti-palette" style="color:var(--accent-ink)"></i> Design system</h3><span class="lib-sub">The look is the moat. Every slide ships with design direction, not just copy.</span></div>
      <div class="card card-pad">
        <div class="ds-grid">
          <div class="ds-legend">
            <div class="ds-row"><span class="ds-key">Annotation</span><div>Hand-drawn marker overlay. <b style="color:var(--rose-ink)">Red underline</b> marks the pain or wrong path, <b style="color:var(--accent-ink)">green</b> the win, a <b style="color:var(--rose-ink)">red box</b> rings the receipt, a blue arrow points at proof. One to three per slide, never a clean line.</div></div>
            <div class="ds-row"><span class="ds-key">Type</span><div>Heavy sans in white pill-boxes with a red word for emphasis. Body is white drop-shadow text on the image. Carousels add a giant ghost number and a serif-plus-sans cover.</div></div>
            <div class="ds-row"><span class="ds-key">Image class</span><div><span class="badge b-green">proof screenshot</span> <span class="badge b-indigo">device mockup</span> <span class="badge b-gray">proof wall</span> <span class="badge b-gray">real workspace</span>. Lifestyle flex is not an option, by design.</div></div>
            <div class="ds-row"><span class="ds-key">Chip code</span><div>Colour-coded metadata pills on taxonomy slides: cadence, function, audience. Absorb the metadata without reading prose.</div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="slide-real">
            <span class="imgclass">image: student dashboard</span>
            <div class="pillbox">She was stuck at <span class="red">2k/mo</span> for months.</div>
            <div class="mk">The Repeat Purchase Engine<svg class="u" viewBox="0 0 200 8" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path d="M2 5 Q50 1 100 4 T198 3" fill="none" stroke="#34d399" stroke-width="3.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div>
            <div class="receipt">Stripe: <span class="red">$50,120</span> collected</div>
            <div class="body">Same student, same offer, different model. The proof is on screen, not in a caption.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lib-h" style="margin-top:28px"><h3><i class="ti ti-layers-subtract" style="color:var(--accent-ink)"></i> Story sequences</h3><span class="lib-sub">Labeled by date. Expand for slides, retention, and retest.</span>
        <div class="seg" id="seqSeg"><button class="on" data-f="all">All</button><button data-f="live">Live</button><button data-f="review">In review</button><button data-f="testing">Testing</button></div>
      </div>
      <div id="seqLib"></div>
      <div class="lib-h" style="margin-top:26px"><h3><i class="ti ti-layout-grid" style="color:var(--indigo-ink)"></i> Carousels</h3><span class="lib-sub">Labeled by number. Expand for slides and saves.</span></div>
      <div id="carLib"></div>
    </section>

    <!-- REELS -->
    <section class="section panel" data-panel="reels">
      <div class="h-row"><div><h1>Reels</h1><p>Two ways in: clip what you already made, or turn what is in your head into content. Anything you think can become a piece.</p></div>
        <div class="h-actions"><button class="btn btn-ghost" onclick="toast('Clip a video','Paste a YouTube or call link, demo')"><i class="ti ti-scissors"></i> Clip a video</button><button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="$('captureInput').focus()"><i class="ti ti-bulb"></i> Capture a thought</button></div>
      </div>

      <div class="reel-modes">
        <div class="mode-card"><div class="ic" style="background:var(--indigo-soft);color:var(--indigo-ink)"><i class="ti ti-scissors"></i></div><h4>Redistribution</h4><p>Long-form video and sales calls become clips. We find the punchy 30 to 60 second moments, cut, hook, and caption them.</p><button class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" onclick="toast('Clip a video','Paste a YouTube or call link, demo')"><i class="ti ti-link"></i> Paste a link</button></div>
        <div class="mode-card"><div class="ic" style="background:var(--accent-soft);color:var(--accent-ink)"><i class="ti ti-bulb"></i></div><h4>Origination</h4><p>A win, a strategy, or a belief you hold becomes a talking-head reel. You think it, we frame it, you film it in your own words.</p><button class="btn btn-soft btn-sm" onclick="$('captureInput').focus()"><i class="ti ti-plus"></i> Start from a thought</button></div>
      </div>

      <div class="capture">
        <h3>Capture inbox</h3>
        <p>Drop a raw thought the moment it hits. One line or a voice note. We route it through a proven angle and turn it into a reel plus the other formats.</p>
        <div class="capture-in"><input id="captureInput" placeholder="e.g. closed a client who was skeptical about paying upfront" autocomplete="off" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter')addThought()"><button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="addThought()"><i class="ti ti-arrow-right"></i> Translate</button></div>
      </div>
      <div id="thoughtList" style="margin-bottom:28px"></div>

      <div class="lib-h"><h3><i class="ti ti-route-2" style="color:var(--accent-ink)"></i> Angle library</h3><span class="lib-sub">Every thought routes through one of these. You are not inventing a format, you are choosing a proven one.</span></div>
      <div class="angle-lib" id="angleLib" style="margin-bottom:28px"></div>

      <div class="lib-h"><h3><i class="ti ti-refresh-dot" style="color:var(--accent-ink)"></i> Reframe rotator</h3><span class="lib-sub">Say the same core belief many ways. Repeat the money message without it feeling repeated.</span></div>
      <div class="rotator">
        <div class="rot-belief"><i class="ti ti-quote"></i> "You do not need a bigger audience. You need a profile that converts the one you have."</div>
        <div class="rot-list" id="rotList"></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- PLANS -->
    <section class="section panel" data-panel="plans">
      <div class="h-row"><div><h1>Plans</h1><p>Your game plan, phase by phase.</p></div><span class="badge b-green" style="align-self:center">Phase 1 of 4</span></div>
      <div class="grid g2">
        <div class="plan"><div class="plan-top"><h4>Phase 1, profile funnel</h4><span class="badge b-green">In progress</span></div><div class="bar"><i style="width:70%"></i></div><p>Bio rewrite, start-here highlight, and proof pin post go live this week.</p><div class="pmeta"><i class="ti ti-calendar"></i> Jul 8 to Jul 20 <span style="margin-left:auto" class="mono">70%</span></div></div>
        <div class="plan"><div class="plan-top"><h4>Phase 2, sequence engine</h4><span class="badge b-gray">Next</span></div><div class="bar"><i style="width:15%"></i></div><p>5 sequences a week across the 7 types, tracked in Performance.</p><div class="pmeta"><i class="ti ti-calendar"></i> starts Jul 21 <span style="margin-left:auto" class="mono">15%</span></div></div>
        <div class="plan"><div class="plan-top"><h4>Phase 3, reels ladder</h4><span class="badge b-gray">Queued</span></div><div class="bar"><i style="width:0%"></i></div><p>Match reel formats to stage. Reach first, then harvest.</p><div class="pmeta"><i class="ti ti-calendar"></i> Aug <span style="margin-left:auto" class="mono">0%</span></div></div>
        <div class="plan"><div class="plan-top"><h4>Phase 4, offer and funnel</h4><span class="badge b-gray">Queued</span></div><div class="bar"><i style="width:0%"></i></div><p>Tighten the offer and the DM-to-call path.</p><div class="pmeta"><i class="ti ti-calendar"></i> Aug <span style="margin-left:auto" class="mono">0%</span></div></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- TODOS -->
    <section class="section panel" data-panel="todos">
      <div class="h-row"><div><h1>To-dos</h1><p>Check off what's yours. Grayed items are ours to handle.</p></div></div>
      <div style="max-width:660px" id="todoList"></div>
    </section>

    <!-- TEAM -->
    <section class="section panel" data-panel="team">
      <div class="h-row"><div><h1>Team</h1><p>Who's on your build, and what they're working on today.</p></div></div>
      <div class="team-grid" style="margin-bottom:26px" id="teamGrid"></div>
      <h3 style="font-size:15px;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:0 0 14px">What everyone's working on</h3>
      <div class="board" id="board"></div>
    </section>

    <!-- INTEGRATIONS -->
    <section class="section panel" data-panel="integrations">
      <div class="h-row"><div><h1>Integrations</h1><p>Connect the tools that feed your numbers and run your automations. Everything the funnel touches plugs in here.</p></div>
        <div class="h-actions"><button class="btn btn-ghost" onclick="syncAll()"><i class="ti ti-refresh"></i> Sync all</button><button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="scrollToEl('marketplace')"><i class="ti ti-plus"></i> Add a connection</button></div>
      </div>
      <div class="intg-summary">
        <div class="sum-card"><div class="l">Connected</div><div class="v mono" id="sumConnected"><span class="dotb" style="background:var(--accent)"></span> 1</div></div>
        <div class="sum-card"><div class="l">Available</div><div class="v mono" id="sumAvailable">25</div></div>
        <div class="sum-card"><div class="l">Automations live</div><div class="v mono" id="sumAutos"><span class="dotb" style="background:var(--accent)"></span> 4</div></div>
        <div class="sum-card"><div class="l">Last sync</div><div class="v mono" style="font-size:16px" id="sumSync">2 min ago</div></div>
      </div>

      <div class="lib-h"><h3><i class="ti ti-robot" style="color:var(--accent-ink)"></i> Active automations</h3><span class="lib-sub">Triggers wired to actions. This is the backend the client never sees running.</span></div>
      <div id="autoList" style="margin-bottom:28px"></div>

      <div class="lib-h" id="marketplace"><h3><i class="ti ti-apps" style="color:var(--accent-ink)"></i> Connect a tool</h3><span class="lib-sub">Search or filter by category, then open a card to see what it syncs.</span></div>
      <div class="search"><i class="ti ti-search"></i><input id="svcSearch" placeholder="Search Stripe, Kit, Instagram, Zapier..." autocomplete="off"></div>
      <div class="cat-bar" id="catBar"></div>
      <div class="svc-grid" id="svcGrid"></div>
    </section>

    <!-- SETTINGS -->
    <section class="section panel" data-panel="settings">
      <div class="h-row"><div><h1>Settings</h1><p>Everything about your workspace, in one place.</p></div><button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="toast('Settings saved','Changes applied to your workspace')"><i class="ti ti-check"></i> Save changes</button></div>
      <div class="subtabs" id="setNav"></div>

      <div class="set-sec on" data-set="workspace"><div class="set-card">
        <div class="set-grid">
          <div class="field"><label>Business name</label><input value="Rio Vance"></div>
          <div class="field"><label>Niche</label><input value="Subscription dropshipping mentorship"></div>
          <div class="field"><label>Timezone</label><select><option>Europe/Berlin</option><option>America/New_York</option><option>UTC</option></select></div>
          <div class="field"><label>Revenue goal</label><input value="$100,000"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="field"><label>Trigger word <span class="hint">the DM keyword that starts your funnel</span></label><input value="elevate"></div>
        <div class="field"><label>Client portal link</label><input value="pulsify-funnels.pages.dev/rio-vance" readonly></div>
        <button class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" onclick="toast('Copied','Portal link on your clipboard')"><i class="ti ti-copy"></i> Copy link</button>
      </div></div>

      <div class="set-sec" data-set="brand"><div class="set-card">
        <div class="field"><label>Proof currency <span class="hint">what carries the selling</span></label><select><option>Student results only</option><option>Student results plus process</option></select></div>
        <div class="note" style="margin-bottom:16px"><b>Locked rule.</b> Proof is student results, never lifestyle. No cars, watches, or income flexing. This is the Pulsify positioning and it does not change per client.</div>
        <div class="field"><label>Banned words <span class="hint">the generator will avoid these</span></label><input value="passive income, get rich, guaranteed, secret"></div>
        <div class="field"><label>Voice</label><select><option>Direct, operator tone</option><option>Warm, mentor tone</option></select></div>
        <div class="set-row"><div class="l"><b>Kill AI tells on every draft</b><span>No negative parallelism, no em-dashes, no filler</span></div><div class="switch on" role="switch" aria-checked="true" tabindex="0" onclick="tSwitch(this)" onkeydown="swKey(event,this)"><i></i></div></div>
      </div></div>

      <div class="set-sec" data-set="content"><div class="set-card">
        <div class="set-row"><div class="l"><b>Sequence review gate</b><span>Pulsify reviews before you post</span></div><div class="switch on" role="switch" aria-checked="true" tabindex="0" onclick="tSwitch(this)" onkeydown="swKey(event,this)"><i></i></div></div>
        <div class="set-row"><div class="l"><b>Auto-draft a retest on a leak</b><span>When completion drops below 40%</span></div><div class="switch on" role="switch" aria-checked="true" tabindex="0" onclick="tSwitch(this)" onkeydown="swKey(event,this)"><i></i></div></div>
        <div class="field" style="margin-top:16px"><label>Weekly cadence target</label><select><option>5 to 7 sequences</option><option>3 to 5 sequences</option><option>7 plus sequences</option></select></div>
        <div class="field"><label>Default sequence goal</label><select><option>Booked calls</option><option>DMs</option><option>Reach</option></select></div>
      </div></div>

      <div class="set-sec" data-set="notifications"><div class="set-card">
        <div class="set-row"><div class="l"><b>Weekly report email</b><span>Every Monday, your read for the week</span></div><div class="switch on" role="switch" aria-checked="true" tabindex="0" onclick="tSwitch(this)" onkeydown="swKey(event,this)"><i></i></div></div>
        <div class="set-row"><div class="l"><b>New DM alert</b><span>When a lead uses your trigger word</span></div><div class="switch on" role="switch" aria-checked="true" tabindex="0" onclick="tSwitch(this)" onkeydown="swKey(event,this)"><i></i></div></div>
        <div class="set-row"><div class="l"><b>Drop-off alert</b><span>When a live sequence starts leaking</span></div><div class="switch on" role="switch" aria-checked="true" tabindex="0" onclick="tSwitch(this)" onkeydown="swKey(event,this)"><i></i></div></div>
        <div class="set-row"><div class="l"><b>Payment alert</b><span>When cash lands in a connected rail</span></div><div class="switch" role="switch" aria-checked="false" tabindex="0" onclick="tSwitch(this)" onkeydown="swKey(event,this)"><i></i></div></div>
      </div></div>

      <div class="set-sec" data-set="access"><div class="set-card">
        <div class="set-row"><div class="l"><b>Show revenue to team</b><span>Off by default</span></div><div class="switch" role="switch" aria-checked="false" tabindex="0" onclick="tSwitch(this)" onkeydown="swKey(event,this)"><i></i></div></div>
        <div class="set-row"><div class="l"><b>Let the setter see DMs</b><span>Herman, setter</span></div><div class="switch on" role="switch" aria-checked="true" tabindex="0" onclick="tSwitch(this)" onkeydown="swKey(event,this)"><i></i></div></div>
        <div class="note" style="margin:16px 0"><b>Roles.</b> Operator sees everything. Content sees Studio and Performance. Setter sees DMs and bookings. Manage seats in the Team tab.</div>
        <button class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" onclick="go('team')"><i class="ti ti-users"></i> Open team</button>
      </div></div>

      <div class="set-sec" data-set="billing"><div class="set-card">
        <div class="field"><label>Plan</label><input value="Pulsify growth, monthly" readonly></div>
        <div class="set-row"><div class="l"><b>Next invoice</b><span>Aug 1</span></div><span class="mono" style="font-weight:800">$2,500</span></div>
        <div class="set-row"><div class="l"><b>Payment method</b><span>Visa ending 4242</span></div><button class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm">Update</button></div>
        <div style="margin-top:22px;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)"><div style="font-size:11px;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;color:var(--rose-ink);margin-bottom:12px">Danger zone</div>
          <div class="set-row" style="border:none"><div class="l"><b>Rotate portal link</b><span>Kills the old link, ends access</span></div><button class="btn btn-danger btn-sm">Rotate</button></div>
        </div>
      </div></div>
    </section>
  </main>
</div>

<div class="backdrop" id="backdrop" onclick="closeAll()"></div>

<!-- studio generator modal -->
<div class="modal" id="typeModal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="tmTitle">
  <div class="modal-head"><div style="display:flex;gap:13px;align-items:center"><div class="ic" id="tmIc"></div><div><h3 id="tmTitle"></h3><div class="sub" id="tmSub"></div></div></div><button class="icon-btn" onclick="closeAll()" aria-label="Close"><i class="ti ti-x"></i></button></div>
  <div class="modal-body">
    <div class="grid g2" style="gap:14px;margin-bottom:4px">
      <div class="field"><label>Topic</label><input value="Student went from 2k to 70k months"></div>
